1
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:34,290
You know where he is?

2
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:36,170
Yeah.

3
00:01:38,344 --> 00:01:39,490
Should be easy then.

4
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:41,750
Let's go.

5
00:01:43,049 --> 00:01:44,770
Ooh, yes, that's it.

6
00:01:44,930 --> 00:01:45,930
That's it.

7
00:01:46,690 --> 00:01:51,110
Oh, baby, I'm telling you, you gotta love
the Leaf Village.

8
00:01:51,490 --> 00:01:54,290
The girls here are off the charts.

9
00:01:56,353 --> 00:01:59,164
You're still playing the buffoon,
I see.

10
00:01:59,763 --> 00:02:02,350
[chuckles]
Uhh, just doing a little research.

11
00:02:03,279 --> 00:02:06,550
So, old man Homura and Koharu-sensei.

12
00:02:07,649 --> 00:02:10,389
What could you two scholarly advisors want
with me?

13
00:02:21,291 --> 00:02:22,411
Look at this.

14
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,696
Aah!

15
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,880
No, Lord Kazakage.

16
00:02:29,068 --> 00:02:29,617
Ngh!

17
00:02:30,949 --> 00:02:32,549
They've been dead for a while.

18
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:36,290
My guess, since before the Chunin exams.

19
00:02:37,082 --> 00:02:38,362
I see now.

20
00:02:38,386 --> 00:02:40,006
So that's what his game was.

21
00:02:42,047 --> 00:02:44,707
Curse you, Orochimaru.

22
00:02:48,672 --> 00:02:50,996
After the Kazakage was killed

23
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:54,950
Orochimaru, or Kabuto maybe,
assumed his identity.

24
00:02:56,986 --> 00:02:58,386
We were careless.

25
00:03:05,107 --> 00:03:07,107
Sarutobi...

26
00:03:08,078 --> 00:03:10,078
You didn't think it would be
easy, did you?

27
00:03:11,117 --> 00:03:12,918
Look who you were playing with

28
00:03:12,930 --> 00:03:16,673
One of the most renowned ninja in
all the five great Shinobi nations

29
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:19,590
You did very well though

30
00:03:19,943 --> 00:03:21,681
Two of the five are now out of the way

31
00:03:21,675 --> 00:03:23,062
Shut your mouth!

32
00:03:24,481 --> 00:03:26,539
I won't be patronized.

33
00:03:27,135 --> 00:03:29,015
Do you understand me?

34
00:03:29,438 --> 00:03:31,218
I'll kill you.

35
00:03:34,773 --> 00:03:35,773
Forgive me.

36
00:03:35,976 --> 00:03:37,397
I didn't wish to..

37
00:03:38,589 --> 00:03:41,225
 I'll grant you we didn't bring
down the village,

38
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:44,020
but let us not forget our other objective.

39
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:45,703
Sasuke

40
00:03:46,281 --> 00:03:47,416
you've done it.

41
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,400
Your leash is around his neck.

42
00:03:50,308 --> 00:03:52,094
[Orochimaru chuckles]

43
00:03:52,118 --> 00:03:57,138
And all that it cost me were my arms and
the entirety of my jutsu.

44
00:03:59,482 --> 00:04:04,132
If I'd only gotten hold of Itachi Uchiha
from the beginning

45
00:04:04,157 --> 00:04:06,504
We wouldn't be in this mess.

46
00:04:07,102 --> 00:04:08,582
But it's too late now.

47
00:04:09,235 --> 00:04:10,835
That dream has died.

48
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,819
Itachi is stronger than I am.

49
00:04:14,844 --> 00:04:20,804
That is why... I pulled myself
out of that organization.

50
00:04:21,555 --> 00:04:27,358
The Sand Village has stated publicly that
Orochimaru was responsible for all of this.

51
00:04:27,383 --> 00:04:31,686
At any rate, they've offered their
complete surrender to the Leaf Village.

52
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:34,685
So at the moment, their betrayal is a moot
point.

53
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,758
For now, we have no
choice but to accept their

54
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:41,512
surrender in order to shore
up our power in the region.

55
00:04:41,537 --> 00:04:43,080
That's correct.

56
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:47,636
However, the strength of the Leaf Village
has just suffered an enormous blow.

57
00:04:47,985 --> 00:04:50,786
As things now stand,
our top priority

58
00:04:50,811 --> 00:04:54,466
is preparing for the onslaught
we believe will come.

59
00:04:54,681 --> 00:04:56,747
We have no way of
knowing when one of the

60
00:04:56,771 --> 00:04:59,381
surrounding nations
might try to make a play.

61
00:04:59,587 --> 00:05:03,822
Therefore, until the village
has regained its strength

62
00:05:03,847 --> 00:05:07,379
We've decided to gather the 
top shinobi from each squad

63
00:05:07,404 --> 00:05:12,276
And assemble an emergency executive
committee to handle the situation.

64
00:05:12,655 --> 00:05:13,896
But first...

65
00:05:16,493 --> 00:05:20,223
We need a strong and
trustworthy leader.

66
00:05:20,730 --> 00:05:23,275
It is more than just Orochimaru.

67
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:26,660
It is the seed of a far greater struggle.

68
00:05:27,140 --> 00:05:31,725
Look, guys, I don't know why you're going
to the trouble of explaining all this to me

69
00:05:32,382 --> 00:05:34,760
But if you'll excuse me, I've got to
get back to w-

70
00:05:34,796 --> 00:05:37,499
I think you'll be interested
in what our plans are.

71
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:40,855
This village needs the fifth Hokage
immediately.

72
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:42,986
And yesterday, at an
emergency meeting with

73
00:05:43,046 --> 00:05:46,375
the Lord of the Land
of Fire, it was decided.

74
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:49,225
We chose you, Jiraiya.

75
00:05:49,249 --> 00:05:50,895
Oh, I don't know.

76
00:05:50,921 --> 00:05:52,561
It's not really up my alley.

77
00:05:52,889 --> 00:05:54,759
It has been decided.

78
00:05:54,783 --> 00:05:58,296
Besides, if one of the renowned
Sannin is not suited,

79
00:05:58,321 --> 00:06:00,089
Then who else is?

80
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:04,856
If you're so set on a Sannin,
there is another.

81
00:06:04,835 --> 00:06:06,128
Huh?

82
00:06:07,470 --> 00:06:08,560
You're forgetting Tsunade.

83
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:15,834
There's little doubt that the 
child has the capability

84
00:06:16,207 --> 00:06:19,326
But it hardly matters.
No one even knows where she is.

85
00:06:19,351 --> 00:06:20,900
I'm sure I can dig her up.

86
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:23,368
You don't have a problem with that,
do you?

87
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:24,980
But, uh...

88
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,260
Tsunade's got the brains for it.

89
00:06:27,405 --> 00:06:29,160
More than a loafer like me does.

90
00:06:33,195 --> 00:06:34,675
What do you say?

91
00:06:36,726 --> 00:06:37,726
Very well, then.

92
00:06:38,105 --> 00:06:39,185
We'll give it some thought.

93
00:06:39,513 --> 00:06:42,196
But we'll send along
three members of the Anbu

94
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:44,516
Black Ops to accompany
you on your search.

95
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,700
You don't have to worry.

96
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:47,440
I'm not going to make a run for it.

97
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:49,760
Besides, your men will just get in the
way.

98
00:06:51,632 --> 00:06:52,632
Although...

99
00:06:54,625 --> 00:06:58,711
There is one guy I wouldn't mind having
along for the ride.

100
00:06:58,736 --> 00:07:01,616
I've stumbled across a very interesting
little egg.

101
00:07:03,383 --> 00:07:05,383
[wind howls]

102
00:07:08,455 --> 00:07:10,275
Hey, guys.

103
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:13,279
You two seem to be getting along.

104
00:07:13,342 --> 00:07:14,585
Huh!? Idiot.

105
00:07:14,610 --> 00:07:17,700
Anko just asked me to pick up some rice
dumplings for her.

106
00:07:17,725 --> 00:07:20,755
What are you doing here, aside from
catching up on your reading?

107
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:24,265
Ah, I need to buy something
to put on a grave.

108
00:07:24,290 --> 00:07:25,870
Plus, I'm meeting somebody here.

109
00:07:26,536 --> 00:07:29,009
I'm just waiting on Sasuke.

110
00:07:30,073 --> 00:07:33,569
Hah! It's not like you to be
waiting on somebody.

111
00:07:34,710 --> 00:07:36,222
Is it for Obito?

112
00:07:36,684 --> 00:07:37,684
Obito?

113
00:07:38,015 --> 00:07:40,730
Uh, yeah, kind of.

114
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:43,763
[glass thunks]

115
00:07:47,646 --> 00:07:49,895
Kakashi, it's not like you to show up
early.

116
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,068
What gives?

117
00:07:51,401 --> 00:07:53,741
Well, sometimes I do.

118
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,600
Let's eat somewhere else.

119
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:04,140
I don't have much of a sweet tooth.

120
00:08:04,862 --> 00:08:07,017
Hmm. Is that so?

121
00:08:08,417 --> 00:08:10,019
[woosh]

122
00:08:10,195 --> 00:08:11,516
Mmm! [slurps]

123
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:13,720
Yeah, what happened there was...

124
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:17,220
I stuck it behind my headband because I
was so freaked out it was going to fall

125
00:08:17,221 --> 00:08:20,465
out of my pants or something while I was
working out earlier this morning.

126
00:08:21,511 --> 00:08:22,426
[chuckles]

127
00:08:23,249 --> 00:08:25,209
Well, it all worked out in the end.

128
00:08:25,233 --> 00:08:27,732
Now go on, eat up so you can do your best.

129
00:08:27,756 --> 00:08:28,756
Huh?

130
00:08:29,330 --> 00:08:32,069
You've got more training ahead of you,
don't you?

131
00:08:32,718 --> 00:08:34,433
[chuckles]

132
00:08:35,613 --> 00:08:37,959
You bet I do!
I'm going to work my butt off!

133
00:08:37,983 --> 00:08:40,565
That's the spirit!
Here, have some more.

134
00:08:41,690 --> 00:08:42,885
Hm?

135
00:08:42,909 --> 00:08:44,516
That one there is on the house.

136
00:08:44,541 --> 00:08:45,600
Dig in!

137
00:08:45,624 --> 00:08:48,587
Oh man, thanks a bunch!
[chuckles]

138
00:08:49,332 --> 00:08:50,732
Hey there, come on in.

139
00:08:50,756 --> 00:08:53,256
I had to see it with my own eyes.

140
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:53,760
Hm?

141
00:08:53,761 --> 00:08:56,840
It looks like you do eat nothing but
ramen, huh, short stuff?

142
00:08:57,660 --> 00:08:58,688
Huh?

143
00:08:58,713 --> 00:09:00,381
The pervy sage!

144
00:09:10,133 --> 00:09:13,075
It's been a long time, Asuma, Kuranai.

145
00:09:13,514 --> 00:09:15,854
The fact that you know
our names must mean

146
00:09:15,883 --> 00:09:19,403
that you're a shinobi
formerly of this village.

147
00:09:22,859 --> 00:09:24,132
[gasp]

148
00:09:24,546 --> 00:09:26,546
Y-you're...

149
00:09:27,481 --> 00:09:28,575
[bell jingles]

150
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:36,403
Heh.
Well, what do you know?

151
00:09:36,798 --> 00:09:39,415
Itachi Uchiha.

152
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:42,304
Are these friends of yours, Itachi?

153
00:09:43,184 --> 00:09:44,576
Well then...

154
00:09:45,297 --> 00:09:48,479
I suppose I should introduce myself.

155
00:09:50,807 --> 00:09:53,030
Hope we can get acquainted later.

156
00:09:53,055 --> 00:09:55,175
The name's Kisame Hoshigaki.

157
00:09:57,565 --> 00:09:59,684
Why should we wait till later,

158
00:09:59,713 --> 00:10:02,546
When I can just wipe the
floor with you both now?

159
00:10:02,571 --> 00:10:04,331
Boy, Itachi

160
00:10:04,355 --> 00:10:08,175
It looks like they hate you as much
in this village as they do in mine.

161
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,660
We know who you are, Kisame.

162
00:10:10,349 --> 00:10:11,889
We've heard all about you.

163
00:10:11,913 --> 00:10:13,772
You hail from the Village of the Mist.

164
00:10:14,059 --> 00:10:17,396
Suspected of espionage and the
murder of a feudal lord.

165
00:10:17,421 --> 00:10:21,121
You're a rogue ninja from the Land of
Water, wanted in every nation.

166
00:10:21,963 --> 00:10:24,802
You're a high-level S-rank criminal

167
00:10:24,826 --> 00:10:27,123
listed prominently in the Bingo book.

168
00:10:29,817 --> 00:10:32,175
This guy is getting on my nerves.

169
00:10:32,211 --> 00:10:34,197
Can I kill him?

170
00:10:34,222 --> 00:10:36,862
Well, I guess we're not going anywhere
without a fight.

171
00:10:37,877 --> 00:10:39,737
Just try not to overdo it.

172
00:10:39,985 --> 00:10:42,464
Your moves tend to stand out.

173
00:10:43,227 --> 00:10:45,586
They're as good as dead.

174
00:10:49,409 --> 00:10:51,070
[grunts]

175
00:11:10,383 --> 00:11:12,094
I see.

176
00:11:12,888 --> 00:11:14,849
Genjutsu.

177
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,865
He's bearing down with just the edge of
his sword.

178
00:11:24,890 --> 00:11:26,410
His strength is unreal.

179
00:11:29,755 --> 00:11:32,532
My massive blade, Sharkskin.

180
00:11:33,812 --> 00:11:37,062
Hyah!

181
00:11:40,738 --> 00:11:42,368
It doesn't slice.

182
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,387
It cuts you to ribbons!

183
00:11:50,949 --> 00:11:53,249
It's about time, Kurenai.

184
00:12:14,430 --> 00:12:16,109
Let's end this!

185
00:12:22,189 --> 00:12:25,412
Genjutsu of that level
doesn't work on me.

186
00:12:25,763 --> 00:12:27,763
<i>He used a Genjutsu reflection?</i>

187
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,200
[yells]

188
00:12:43,052 --> 00:12:44,074
Kurenai!

189
00:12:44,102 --> 00:12:46,484
I wouldn't be looking over there
If I were you.

190
00:12:47,262 --> 00:12:49,102
You live up to your reputation.

191
00:12:50,096 --> 00:12:54,173
However... [interrupted]
However, this is the end of the line.

192
00:12:54,202 --> 00:12:56,194
For you, anyway.

193
00:12:58,504 --> 00:12:59,504
What?

194
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:08,040
Water style.

195
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:15,520
[simultaneous]
Water Shark Bomb Jutsu!

196
00:13:19,822 --> 00:13:22,322
He broke out the same jutsu that I did.

197
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,711
Not that I'm unhappy to see you,
but what are you doing here?

198
00:13:25,736 --> 00:13:30,027
Well, you know, I asked you to take care
of those two earlier.

199
00:13:30,335 --> 00:13:32,295
But I guess I got a little worried.

200
00:13:33,900 --> 00:13:35,665
Kakashi.

201
00:13:35,690 --> 00:13:37,338
It's you.

202
00:13:38,402 --> 00:13:41,334
Those eyes haven't changed.

203
00:13:41,993 --> 00:13:44,973
This one's a true heir of the Sharingan.

204
00:13:45,735 --> 00:13:48,555
That means I've got to be ready for the
worst.

205
00:13:49,644 --> 00:13:51,364
Well, well, what a surprise.

206
00:13:51,388 --> 00:13:53,528
That's how you copied my jutsu.

207
00:13:54,002 --> 00:13:58,745
So there really is someone besides Itachi
with those crazy eyes.

208
00:13:59,429 --> 00:14:01,566
You're Kakashi, aren't you?

209
00:14:01,591 --> 00:14:02,935
The copy ninja.

210
00:14:03,276 --> 00:14:05,217
You can imagine my surprise.

211
00:14:05,242 --> 00:14:09,720
I go to check out a couple of low-life
vagabonds in the tea house, and I find

212
00:14:09,721 --> 00:14:14,308
none other than Itachi Uchiha
and Kisame Hoshigaki

213
00:14:14,333 --> 00:14:16,535
The scourge of the
Hidden Mist Village.

214
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,015
How about that?

215
00:14:18,207 --> 00:14:19,747
You know my name.

216
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:20,940
I'm honored.

217
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:24,439
I assume that bizarre
excuse for a sword is

218
00:14:24,463 --> 00:14:27,235
one of the seven ninja
swordmen of the mist.

219
00:14:27,935 --> 00:14:29,902
The one called Sharkskin?

220
00:14:29,911 --> 00:14:31,320
Hahahahaha!

221
00:14:31,344 --> 00:14:35,024
I heard that you and Zabuza
had it out a while back.

222
00:14:36,097 --> 00:14:37,877
Yes, we did.

223
00:14:39,057 --> 00:14:40,565
Ngh!

224
00:14:42,165 --> 00:14:43,265
Go ahead.

225
00:14:43,367 --> 00:14:46,322
I'd love to cut you to ribbons.

226
00:14:46,347 --> 00:14:47,807
Kisame, stop it.

227
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:49,320
Huh?

228
00:14:51,749 --> 00:14:54,620
If you take this man on, it won't be
without cost.

229
00:14:55,819 --> 00:14:58,530
Furthermore, it will take
time, and the commotion

230
00:14:58,531 --> 00:15:00,861
is liable to bring
more shinobi running.

231
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:05,000
Your way is inefficient and unnecessarily
risky.

232
00:15:05,020 --> 00:15:07,360
Don't lose sight of our goal.

233
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:08,860
Let's hear it.

234
00:15:09,109 --> 00:15:10,460
What is your goal exactly?

235
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:16,220
We're looking for something, and we know
it's here.

236
00:15:17,079 --> 00:15:18,400
And what would that be?

237
00:15:31,549 --> 00:15:35,169
My way is more...
efficient than Kisame's.

238
00:15:36,328 --> 00:15:38,728
Ninja art, water style, water wall!

239
00:15:46,423 --> 00:15:48,383
The speed of his jutsu is incredible.

240
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:50,260
I didn't even see a hand sign.

241
00:15:51,445 --> 00:15:56,726
The shuriken in his hand were just a ruse
to distract me from his water style attack.

242
00:15:57,327 --> 00:15:58,327
You're good.

243
00:15:58,987 --> 00:16:01,407
You almost anticipated my moves.

244
00:16:02,156 --> 00:16:03,156
Almost.

245
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:05,980
A shadow clone!

246
00:16:06,141 --> 00:16:07,741
His speed is too great.

247
00:16:11,421 --> 00:16:12,981
A water clone?

248
00:16:13,419 --> 00:16:17,799
I guess my village should be honored he's
copied our jutsu so well.

249
00:16:20,451 --> 00:16:22,191
Nice job, Kakashi.

250
00:16:22,963 --> 00:16:24,626
Get back, Kurenai!

251
00:16:24,651 --> 00:16:26,231
That one's the shadow clone.

252
00:16:29,528 --> 00:16:31,378
Kakashi! Kurenai!

253
00:16:31,792 --> 00:16:34,072
He just blew up his own shadow clone.

254
00:16:40,812 --> 00:16:41,872
Are you alright?

255
00:16:47,502 --> 00:16:48,643
Stay on your toes.

256
00:16:49,102 --> 00:16:52,662
This guy was made chief of Anbu Black Ops
when he was only thirteen.

257
00:16:53,586 --> 00:16:55,913
For someone who is not of the Uchiha clan,

258
00:16:55,937 --> 00:16:57,747
you have mastered the Sharingan well.

259
00:16:58,504 --> 00:17:02,339
However, not being one of us,
you lack our physical strength

260
00:17:02,364 --> 00:17:04,376
And that's something
you can't copy.

261
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,069
He's right.

262
00:17:06,094 --> 00:17:08,094
My body doesn't have the stamina.

263
00:17:09,184 --> 00:17:12,574
Why is it that the Uchiha clan
is known by all,

264
00:17:12,598 --> 00:17:14,819
And feared by all?

265
00:17:15,176 --> 00:17:16,456
Huh?! It can't be.

266
00:17:16,862 --> 00:17:17,862
Oh no.

267
00:17:18,289 --> 00:17:19,615
Close your eyes!

268
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,761
Don't look at his eyes!

269
00:17:22,862 --> 00:17:24,214
Listen, both of you.

270
00:17:24,239 --> 00:17:26,075
Whatever happens, don't look.

271
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,919
If you meet his gaze, you're finished.

272
00:17:28,864 --> 00:17:30,614
I'm gonna have to do this alone.

273
00:17:30,796 --> 00:17:32,556
My Sharingan against his.

274
00:17:32,849 --> 00:17:34,889
Indeed, your abilities are impressive.

275
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:38,737
They might even be enough to resist the
Mangekyou Sharingan.

276
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:41,818
However...

277
00:17:41,843 --> 00:17:44,392
There is something they
can't defend against.

278
00:17:44,687 --> 00:17:49,197
This special Sharingan jutsu called
Tsukuyomi.

279
00:17:49,222 --> 00:17:54,462
Only someone with the Sharingan and
Kekkei Genkai can defeat me.

280
00:17:55,531 --> 00:17:56,992
Sasuke...

281
00:18:14,822 --> 00:18:19,412
I wonder how much of this someone without
the Kekkei Genkai can take.

282
00:18:23,907 --> 00:18:25,697
In the Tsukuyomi...

283
00:18:25,707 --> 00:18:27,583
[stabs] [grunts]

284
00:18:27,626 --> 00:18:30,679
Time and space...

285
00:18:31,363 --> 00:18:34,724
Even physical mass...
I control them all

286
00:18:35,337 --> 00:18:37,079
Aah!

287
00:18:37,611 --> 00:18:40,921
The next seventy-two hours will
be nothing but this.

288
00:18:40,945 --> 00:18:42,982
Over and over...

289
00:18:42,989 --> 00:18:44,989
[grunting in pain]

290
00:18:49,441 --> 00:18:51,996
[heartbeat pounding]

291
00:18:52,003 --> 00:18:53,382
[gasps]

292
00:18:57,562 --> 00:18:58,942
Kakashi, what is it?

293
00:18:59,329 --> 00:19:00,689
Can we open our eyes now?

294
00:19:00,857 --> 00:19:01,857
No.

295
00:19:02,894 --> 00:19:03,894
Not yet.

296
00:19:06,103 --> 00:19:07,343
What just happened?

297
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:10,928
One second the guy's talking and the next
second you hit the ground!

298
00:19:14,483 --> 00:19:16,523
<i>Three days in that world.</i>

299
00:19:16,642 --> 00:19:19,082
<i>Less than a moment passed in this one.</i>

300
00:19:20,473 --> 00:19:22,633
<i>Why not just kill me?</i>

301
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:26,499
<i>If he wanted to, he could.</i>

302
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:31,196
Hmm. After all that, the fool's 
spirit is still intact.

303
00:19:31,952 --> 00:19:35,272
Meanwhile, you've risked
overusing those eyes of yours.

304
00:19:35,425 --> 00:19:37,428
You know that's dangerous.

305
00:19:41,614 --> 00:19:45,514
This... thing you've come for...
is it Sasuke?

306
00:19:48,610 --> 00:19:49,756
No.

307
00:19:50,452 --> 00:19:52,831
The legacy of the Fourth Hokage.

308
00:19:54,416 --> 00:19:55,856
What's he talking about?

309
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:56,980
What's he after?

310
00:20:00,208 --> 00:20:01,532
[looks super cool]

311
00:20:02,886 --> 00:20:05,198
Naruto...

312
00:20:05,379 --> 00:20:07,664
It's been a long time, Jiraiya.

313
00:20:07,689 --> 00:20:10,838
How many years since you've
even seen the village?

314
00:20:13,663 --> 00:20:15,112
Kakashi...

315
00:20:17,674 --> 00:20:20,165
I'll train Naruto from now on.

316
00:20:20,689 --> 00:20:24,651
The Third Hokage was wise to place the boy
under your supervision.

317
00:20:24,829 --> 00:20:25,949
He's been well looked after.

318
00:20:26,630 --> 00:20:29,010
But even someone of your
remarkable abilities

319
00:20:29,034 --> 00:20:31,115
might not be enough to get him ready.

320
00:20:31,140 --> 00:20:32,155
Ready?

321
00:20:32,187 --> 00:20:33,267
What are you talking about?

322
00:20:34,099 --> 00:20:36,880
I've been keeping a close
watch on Orochimaru all

323
00:20:36,881 --> 00:20:39,918
this time ever since the
day he left the village.

324
00:20:39,943 --> 00:20:42,252
It was clear that he meant
to come back someday, and it

325
00:20:42,253 --> 00:20:45,274
was important to know what
he was planning in the meantime.

326
00:20:46,236 --> 00:20:49,107
For many years, I observed his movements.

327
00:20:49,132 --> 00:20:50,392
But then...

328
00:20:51,937 --> 00:20:52,937
What?

329
00:20:54,380 --> 00:20:56,657
He became part of an organization.

330
00:20:57,250 --> 00:20:58,749
What organization?

331
00:20:58,774 --> 00:20:59,834
What's its purpose?

332
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,919
No one really knows for sure

333
00:21:02,943 --> 00:21:04,288
But it's a roving gang of

334
00:21:04,313 --> 00:21:07,909
nine like-minded shinobi who
call themselves the Akatsuki.

335
00:21:08,497 --> 00:21:11,796
At first, they stuck to small-scale
cloak-and-dagger stuff.

336
00:21:12,116 --> 00:21:13,116
Nothing dramatic.

337
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:16,218
But you knew something big was coming,
considering who they are.

338
00:21:17,323 --> 00:21:19,143
These are not small-timers.

339
00:21:19,343 --> 00:21:21,802
Almost everyone in the
organization is listed in

340
00:21:21,803 --> 00:21:24,620
the bingo book as an
S-class criminal deviant.

341
00:21:26,194 --> 00:21:27,656
For instance

342
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,634
That guy Itachi's one of them.

343
00:21:31,201 --> 00:21:33,228
When nine shinobi
like that get together,

344
00:21:33,253 --> 00:21:35,883
it's not because they
want to do charity work.

345
00:21:36,372 --> 00:21:38,792
Recently, the groups started splitting up.

346
00:21:38,868 --> 00:21:42,288
Orochimaru went off on his own,
while others paired up and dispersed

347
00:21:42,316 --> 00:21:46,062
through different areas, searching
for new jutsu to master.

348
00:21:46,452 --> 00:21:48,332
And other things as well.

349
00:21:49,330 --> 00:21:52,770
And one of these things they're looking
for is the nine-tailed fox?

350
00:21:53,598 --> 00:21:55,638
It's only a... possibility.

351
00:21:56,825 --> 00:21:57,825
Kakashi.

352
00:21:57,900 --> 00:22:00,546
Sooner or later, Naruto must
learn that because of what

353
00:22:00,547 --> 00:22:03,120
he is, he'll have to live
his life watching his back.

354
00:22:05,715 --> 00:22:07,613
That's the boy's destiny.

355
00:22:08,819 --> 00:22:10,560
For now, focus on Sasuke.

356
00:22:11,439 --> 00:22:13,740
It's up to you to teach him how to use his
Sharingan.

357
00:22:16,279 --> 00:22:18,384
And I'll keep an eye on Naruto.

358
00:22:18,409 --> 00:22:20,176
Leave his training to me.

359
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:25,260
The nine-tailed spirit inside Naruto.

360
00:22:25,869 --> 00:22:26,869
That's what you're after?

361
00:22:27,340 --> 00:22:30,059
You're not the only ones, are you?

362
00:22:30,084 --> 00:22:32,184
There are seven more of you out there.

363
00:22:32,631 --> 00:22:34,311
Searching... hunting...

364
00:22:35,289 --> 00:22:36,600
I know all about you.

365
00:22:37,370 --> 00:22:40,530
You call yourselves the Akatsuki,
right?

366
00:22:43,220 --> 00:22:44,220
Akatsuki?

367
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:45,600
Kisame.

368
00:22:45,714 --> 00:22:47,020
We'll take Kakashi with us.

369
00:22:47,419 --> 00:22:49,137
But we don't need the others.

370
00:22:49,162 --> 00:22:50,162
Get rid of them.

371
00:22:53,781 --> 00:22:56,114
Severe Leaf Hurricane!

372
00:23:06,281 --> 00:23:08,321
Well, who have we here?

373
00:23:09,496 --> 00:23:12,816
The Leaf Village's fiercest beast of
battle.

374
00:23:12,840 --> 00:23:14,604
I'm Might Guy!

375
00:23:15,663 --> 00:23:17,316
You're Might Guy, huh?

376
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,600
Mighty stupid looking guy.

377
00:23:19,980 --> 00:23:21,160
Don't underestimate him.

378
00:23:21,820 --> 00:23:22,820
It's him.

379
00:23:23,620 --> 00:23:24,620
Itachi.

380
00:23:33,896 --> 00:23:36,337
What they must have put him through...

381
00:23:36,362 --> 00:23:37,206
Close your eyes.

382
00:23:37,230 --> 00:23:38,230
Don't look at Itachi.

383
00:23:38,490 --> 00:23:40,553
You'll get caught in his jutsu.

384
00:23:40,592 --> 00:23:41,775
Relax.

385
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:42,939
I know what I'm doing.

386
00:23:42,970 --> 00:23:46,331
After spending this much time
training to fight Kakashi,

387
00:23:46,355 --> 00:23:48,515
I know all about Sharingan.

388
00:23:50,556 --> 00:23:51,736
Alright, both of you.

389
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:52,800
Open your eyes, now.

390
00:23:52,869 --> 00:23:54,936
But... if we...

391
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,910
Don't worry, just
don't look in his eyes.

392
00:23:57,250 --> 00:24:00,210
That's the key to fighting an opponent
who's using Sharingan.

393
00:24:00,350 --> 00:24:01,530
Focus on his feet.

394
00:24:01,670 --> 00:24:03,910
You can read what he's gonna do from his
feet.

395
00:24:05,550 --> 00:24:08,650
Alright, but that trick sounds a lot
easier said than done.

396
00:24:09,226 --> 00:24:11,266
We haven't had all your training.

397
00:24:11,290 --> 00:24:12,674
We're not you, Guy.

398
00:24:13,167 --> 00:24:14,213
True.

399
00:24:14,238 --> 00:24:18,250
It takes skill to anticipate an opponent's
moves merely from watching his feet.

400
00:24:18,350 --> 00:24:20,010
But I don't have time to teach you now.

401
00:24:20,925 --> 00:24:22,625
You'll just have to do your best.

402
00:24:24,697 --> 00:24:25,857
So what do we do?

403
00:24:26,413 --> 00:24:28,733
Kurenai, get Kakashi to the medical corp.

404
00:24:29,590 --> 00:24:31,270
Asuma, you'll be my backup.

405
00:24:31,470 --> 00:24:32,470
Got it.

406
00:24:34,072 --> 00:24:35,102
Alright.

407
00:24:35,127 --> 00:24:39,946
I sent word for the Anbu Black Ops,
but until they get here, we hold them off.

408
00:24:40,262 --> 00:24:41,362
Just you and me.

409
00:24:41,730 --> 00:24:42,875
Interesting.

410
00:24:43,082 --> 00:24:45,002
I'll give you credit for guts.

411
00:24:45,711 --> 00:24:46,711
No, Kisame.

412
00:24:46,836 --> 00:24:47,876
We're pulling out.

413
00:24:49,039 --> 00:24:51,399
We're not here to fight a full-scale
battle.

414
00:24:51,899 --> 00:24:54,708
Tempting as it may be, it's not the way to
do this.

415
00:24:54,930 --> 00:24:55,930
Let's go.

416
00:24:56,827 --> 00:24:57,827
That's too bad.

417
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,700
It was just getting fun.

418
00:25:00,349 --> 00:25:02,595
They don't know how lucky they are.

419
00:25:07,730 --> 00:25:08,420
What?

420
00:25:08,445 --> 00:25:09,917
Agh, No way!

421
00:25:09,942 --> 00:25:12,289
How come I get stuck
tagging along with you while

422
00:25:12,313 --> 00:25:15,279
you do research for another
one of your pervy books?

423
00:25:15,966 --> 00:25:16,686
Look, kid.

424
00:25:16,710 --> 00:25:19,490
I can assure you this isn't just another
research trip.

425
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:21,470
There's a woman I have to find.

426
00:25:21,510 --> 00:25:22,830
A very remarkable woman.

427
00:25:23,313 --> 00:25:24,853
Well, count me out, old man.

428
00:25:25,010 --> 00:25:27,577
I don't have time to help you find a
girlfriend.

429
00:25:27,602 --> 00:25:29,542
I've got to get busy with my training.

430
00:25:30,030 --> 00:25:31,202
What training?

431
00:25:31,227 --> 00:25:35,766
It's time Kakashi Sensei taught me
something new, like that Chidori thing.

432
00:25:36,106 --> 00:25:38,806
<i>Why does he always play favorites with
Sasuke?</i>

433
00:25:40,858 --> 00:25:41,858
I see.

434
00:25:41,882 --> 00:25:42,442
Hmm.

435
00:25:42,646 --> 00:25:44,526
You'd just be wasting your time.

436
00:25:44,550 --> 00:25:45,870
Chidori's not really your style.

437
00:25:46,746 --> 00:25:51,326
And besides that, kid, the woman we're
looking for is really beautiful.

438
00:25:51,713 --> 00:25:52,733
I mean gorgeous.

439
00:25:53,205 --> 00:25:54,325
Like I care.

440
00:25:54,350 --> 00:25:56,950
Look, pervy sage, who do you think you're
talking to?

441
00:25:57,070 --> 00:26:00,329
I'm not some dumb kid you can fool with
lame excuses.

442
00:26:00,428 --> 00:26:02,174
I'm not going!

443
00:26:02,789 --> 00:26:04,819
Okay, fine. Suit yourself.

444
00:26:04,971 --> 00:26:10,001
And I could have taught you jutsu that
made Chidori look like kid stuff.

445
00:26:11,411 --> 00:26:14,817
Maybe I'll just... see if Sasuke wants to
come.

446
00:26:16,511 --> 00:26:18,311
Right! When do we leave?

447
00:26:19,465 --> 00:26:20,725
I'll go pack my bag.

448
00:26:20,810 --> 00:26:22,450
Stay right there, pervy sage.

449
00:26:22,657 --> 00:26:24,490
I'll be right back. Don't move!

450
00:26:27,335 --> 00:26:29,015
What a knucklehead.

451
00:26:29,039 --> 00:26:30,979
Still, you can't help liking him.

452
00:26:34,589 --> 00:26:35,780
All right, I'm ready.

453
00:26:42,756 --> 00:26:44,976
Well, come on, pervy sage!

454
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,580
I'm on pins and needles.

455
00:26:46,660 --> 00:26:49,014
What's this new jutsu you're going to
teach me?

456
00:26:49,055 --> 00:26:52,015
The last time around it was a walk on
water jutsu.

457
00:26:52,815 --> 00:26:54,705
Ooh, is it walking through fire?

458
00:26:54,869 --> 00:26:58,369
Or wait, maybe walking on air.

459
00:27:00,168 --> 00:27:02,288
Ah, come on, pervy sage.

460
00:27:02,312 --> 00:27:03,452
Let's hear it already.

461
00:27:03,918 --> 00:27:06,578
All right, enough with the pervy sage
already.

462
00:27:06,756 --> 00:27:10,056
You have no idea how amazing a guy I am,
do you?

463
00:27:10,080 --> 00:27:12,240
Huh? What, amazingly pervy?

464
00:27:12,463 --> 00:27:14,552
Gah!? You!

465
00:27:14,577 --> 00:27:16,257
All right, listen up!

466
00:27:17,871 --> 00:27:20,756
The Toad Sage is only my cover.

467
00:27:20,780 --> 00:27:25,280
Allow me to reveal my true identity.

468
00:27:25,808 --> 00:27:28,603
From the north to the
south, and the east to the

469
00:27:28,604 --> 00:27:32,825
west, not even the spirits
can defeat this Sannin.

470
00:27:32,850 --> 00:27:35,540
The white-maned Toad Charmer!

471
00:27:35,700 --> 00:27:39,240
A red-hot ninja who strikes fear in the
hearts of men!

472
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:42,534
Master Jiraiya! Haha!

473
00:27:42,751 --> 00:27:46,071
Yes! I'm speaking of none other than
myself!

474
00:27:46,093 --> 00:27:48,093
Hahahahahahaha!

475
00:27:49,459 --> 00:27:50,459
Uh-huh.

476
00:28:08,727 --> 00:28:10,607
Uh, Atafuku Town.

477
00:28:11,036 --> 00:28:12,696
That's ten kilometers from here.

478
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:15,675
No, it's OH-tofuku Town.
Ohh!

479
00:28:16,052 --> 00:28:17,092
Hey, hey, hey!

480
00:28:17,116 --> 00:28:17,836
Wait a second!

481
00:28:17,860 --> 00:28:18,860
Pervy Sage!

482
00:28:19,876 --> 00:28:22,476
Look, kid, I told you already,
it's Jiraiya.

483
00:28:22,500 --> 00:28:23,729
Come on!

484
00:28:23,754 --> 00:28:26,507
So, the fact that such a
bigwig pervy sage chose me

485
00:28:26,508 --> 00:28:29,471
as his traveling companion
must mean something, right?

486
00:28:29,496 --> 00:28:31,896
I must be a potential genius in the
making!

487
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:34,200
Aw man, it's just like I always thought!

488
00:28:36,593 --> 00:28:38,635
Gyahaha!
Come on, come on, come on!

489
00:28:38,660 --> 00:28:39,920
Why'd you choose me, huh?

490
00:28:42,752 --> 00:28:45,066
Well, the truth is, kid,
a long time ago, the

491
00:28:45,090 --> 00:28:48,095
fourth Hokage used
to be a disciple of mine.

492
00:28:48,996 --> 00:28:49,837
Huh?

493
00:28:49,862 --> 00:28:54,142
And you bear such a striking resemblance
to the fourth that it's almost laughable.

494
00:28:54,994 --> 00:28:57,234
Sorry, that's the only reason I got for
you.

495
00:28:59,135 --> 00:29:01,523
So wait...

496
00:29:01,547 --> 00:29:02,735
I'm like the fourth?

497
00:29:05,907 --> 00:29:07,326
Holy crap!
Aah!

498
00:29:07,351 --> 00:29:08,914
That's awesome!
Hahahaha!

499
00:29:08,939 --> 00:29:11,171
What's up with you?
Oh man!

500
00:29:11,206 --> 00:29:12,436
[giggles]

501
00:29:12,796 --> 00:29:16,396
If I'm like the fourth Hokage, that means I
possess the same level of genius he did!

502
00:29:16,681 --> 00:29:18,777
I'm on my way to Hokage after all!

503
00:29:18,789 --> 00:29:20,789
Woohoo! Hahahaha!

504
00:29:22,243 --> 00:29:23,966
Huh! Hah! Hoo!

505
00:29:24,026 --> 00:29:25,967
Ah, yippee!

506
00:29:26,208 --> 00:29:27,223
Huh?

507
00:29:27,214 --> 00:29:28,282
Mh?

508
00:29:28,307 --> 00:29:29,992
Aah! No, no, no!

509
00:29:30,017 --> 00:29:31,564
Wait!

510
00:29:34,942 --> 00:29:35,750
Ah, no!

511
00:29:35,775 --> 00:29:38,031
I just stepped in some dog doo!

512
00:29:38,278 --> 00:29:39,278
[sighs]

513
00:29:52,035 --> 00:29:55,297
[panting]

514
00:29:55,739 --> 00:29:57,196
I wasn't...

515
00:29:58,482 --> 00:30:01,307
<i>I wasn't able to do anything.</i>

516
00:30:03,375 --> 00:30:05,835
I don't ever want to have to see that
again.

517
00:30:06,312 --> 00:30:09,592
Watching all my best friends falling right
in front of me.

518
00:30:11,011 --> 00:30:12,811
No matter what happens!

519
00:30:15,363 --> 00:30:18,060
I swear I'm going to protect you!

520
00:30:18,084 --> 00:30:21,189
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!

521
00:30:28,108 --> 00:30:29,648
Summoning Jutsu!

522
00:30:39,095 --> 00:30:42,700
Naruto just gets stronger and stronger.

523
00:30:43,179 --> 00:30:46,319
Compared to him, I...

524
00:30:57,071 --> 00:30:59,071
Raaaaaagh!

525
00:31:07,015 --> 00:31:11,715
No I'm pretty certain you could go toe-to-toe
with him, though I'm not sure I could.

526
00:31:12,294 --> 00:31:14,334
He's on a whole other level.

527
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:19,180
Yeah... If we faced each other,
both of us would be killed.

528
00:31:20,246 --> 00:31:22,106
A rather unappealing outcome.

529
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:27,330
Even if there were more of us,
the result would remain the same.

530
00:31:27,605 --> 00:31:31,538
Never thought I'd have to go up against
one of the legendary Sanin.

531
00:31:31,563 --> 00:31:35,269
If we fight him, then both 
the Uchiha clan

532
00:31:35,535 --> 00:31:37,791
and the Seven Swordsmen
of the Mist

533
00:31:37,816 --> 00:31:39,999
Will have their names dragged
through the mud.

534
00:31:40,477 --> 00:31:41,477
True.

535
00:31:41,712 --> 00:31:43,498
But still...

536
00:31:43,522 --> 00:31:46,227
Even the strongest of opponents

537
00:31:46,251 --> 00:31:48,447
Always has a weakness.

538
00:32:03,439 --> 00:32:04,439
They're trouble.

539
00:32:04,463 --> 00:32:07,634
But from the look of things, it doesn't
appear they've found Naruto yet.

540
00:32:07,999 --> 00:32:09,600
That's what's crazy.

541
00:32:09,839 --> 00:32:10,920
It doesn't add up.

542
00:32:11,934 --> 00:32:14,635
I mean, they had already infiltrated the
village.

543
00:32:15,109 --> 00:32:18,098
It should be easy for them to find Naruto
around here.

544
00:32:20,057 --> 00:32:22,640
Besides, Itachi knows
Naruto's face already.

545
00:32:23,324 --> 00:32:24,324
Shh!

546
00:32:25,078 --> 00:32:26,078
Kakashi!

547
00:32:27,938 --> 00:32:29,684
Why is Kakashi asleep?

548
00:32:29,796 --> 00:32:31,567
And why is this room full of Jonin?

549
00:32:32,193 --> 00:32:33,314
What are you doing?

550
00:32:33,338 --> 00:32:34,938
What the hell is going on here?

551
00:32:35,029 --> 00:32:37,799
Uh, not much, really.

552
00:32:37,824 --> 00:32:40,107
Hey! is it true that Itachi has returned?

553
00:32:40,450 --> 00:32:42,720
And that he's come here to get Naruto?

554
00:32:43,039 --> 00:32:45,560
Uh... ohh..

555
00:32:45,678 --> 00:32:46,999
Idiot.

556
00:32:53,208 --> 00:32:55,242
Ah, why does this always
have to happen!?

557
00:33:01,589 --> 00:33:03,880
<i>So he's come back to
the village, huh?</i>

558
00:33:04,369 --> 00:33:06,236
<i>And he's after Naruto?</i>

559
00:33:06,260 --> 00:33:07,921
What does this mean?

560
00:33:07,945 --> 00:33:10,757
If Naruto gets caught,
He's dead!

561
00:33:12,188 --> 00:33:14,188
I won't let that happen!

562
00:33:14,828 --> 00:33:16,828
Old man! Naruto stopped
in here today!

563
00:33:17,761 --> 00:33:19,394
Do you know where he went after he left?

564
00:33:20,295 --> 00:33:22,354
Oh, sure. Naruto.

565
00:33:22,464 --> 00:33:23,700
That's right, let me see now.

566
00:33:24,789 --> 00:33:27,575
He met Master Jiraiya here around noon.

567
00:33:28,394 --> 00:33:31,835
They had a little bit of ramen, then they
said they were heading off somewhere.

568
00:33:31,860 --> 00:33:32,860
Where to?

569
00:33:33,360 --> 00:33:34,360
Hmm...

570
00:33:34,759 --> 00:33:36,596
Now that I think of it,
I believe he mentioned

571
00:33:36,621 --> 00:33:39,712
that outpost town a ways
out from the village. Yeah.

572
00:33:40,829 --> 00:33:42,680
And then he set out with Master Jiraiya.

573
00:33:43,315 --> 00:33:44,315
Jiraiya?

574
00:33:45,654 --> 00:33:46,816
Yeah, Jiraiya.

575
00:33:46,841 --> 00:33:49,159
He's one of the legendary Sannin!

576
00:33:49,185 --> 00:33:51,578
Now, if you want to find
him, you're looking for

577
00:33:51,602 --> 00:33:54,096
a great big old fellow
with a head of white hair.

578
00:33:54,120 --> 00:33:55,200
A big guy.

579
00:33:55,320 --> 00:33:56,320
White hair.

580
00:34:06,652 --> 00:34:09,372
Get your candy here!

581
00:34:11,645 --> 00:34:13,755
Naruto!
Huh?

582
00:34:13,780 --> 00:34:15,215
We're gonna crash here tonight.

583
00:34:15,316 --> 00:34:16,072
What?

584
00:34:16,096 --> 00:34:17,477
But why?

585
00:34:17,502 --> 00:34:18,581
I can still walk.

586
00:34:18,730 --> 00:34:21,278
A disciple should always obey his master.

587
00:34:21,303 --> 00:34:23,989
Look, I just want to learn some jutsu,
okay?

588
00:34:24,015 --> 00:34:26,584
Yeah, no kidding, that's what make you a
disciple.

589
00:34:26,767 --> 00:34:28,767
Hmm?
Hm?

590
00:34:31,341 --> 00:34:36,708
[magical harp playing]

591
00:34:36,712 --> 00:34:40,071
[giggling]

592
00:34:44,978 --> 00:34:46,967
Aah! Naruto!
Oh yeah, oh yeah, oh yeah!

593
00:34:46,991 --> 00:34:49,538
Oh yeah, oh yeah, oh yeah!

594
00:34:50,556 --> 00:34:51,416
Here's the room key.

595
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:53,107
I want you to go right
up to the room, train for a

596
00:34:53,131 --> 00:34:55,260
little, work on your chakra,
then get to bed, okay?

597
00:34:55,260 --> 00:34:57,196
Haha!
Wha!?

598
00:34:57,220 --> 00:35:00,600
So I suppose you're gonna tell me it's
time for the grown-ups to play now,

599
00:35:00,660 --> 00:35:02,340
Is that the vibe here, you big perv?

600
00:35:02,860 --> 00:35:04,860
That outpost town isn't that far off.

601
00:35:08,180 --> 00:35:12,821
Oh man, every single time I'm with that
pervy sage, I always end up getting shafted.

602
00:35:18,260 --> 00:35:19,260
This is it.

603
00:35:27,080 --> 00:35:29,820
Get your candy here, get your candy!

604
00:35:31,820 --> 00:35:33,640
Guess I'll just have to go door to door.

605
00:35:34,956 --> 00:35:38,036
Is there a dopey looking blonde kid about
my age staying here now?

606
00:35:38,060 --> 00:35:40,600
He's traveling through the city with a big
guy with white hair?

607
00:35:40,820 --> 00:35:41,840
White hair, you say?

608
00:35:42,600 --> 00:35:43,600
Are they here?

609
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:47,580
Did I see someone like that at the shift
change?

610
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:48,800
I wonder.

611
00:35:49,380 --> 00:35:52,060
This is kind of a bitter drink,
can you handle it?

612
00:35:52,340 --> 00:35:53,400
Okay, bottoms up!

613
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,200
Oh yeah!

614
00:35:55,600 --> 00:35:57,780
A blonde kid and a white-haired old man.

615
00:35:57,860 --> 00:35:58,860
So they're here then?

616
00:35:58,920 --> 00:35:59,920
What room number?

617
00:36:00,460 --> 00:36:02,065
Let's see now.

618
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:06,446
That would be room number one on the
second floor at the end of the hall.

619
00:36:06,475 --> 00:36:07,518
Huh?

620
00:36:14,166 --> 00:36:16,166
[knocking at door]

621
00:36:17,770 --> 00:36:20,348
[knocking continues]

622
00:36:20,828 --> 00:36:22,068
Ah, what now?

623
00:36:22,209 --> 00:36:24,537
Are you telling me she dumped you already?

624
00:36:25,575 --> 00:36:27,535
I heard you the first time!

625
00:36:29,604 --> 00:36:32,444
Okay, hold on, let me just unlock it.

626
00:36:33,041 --> 00:36:34,041
Naruto!

627
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:40,000
You're not...

628
00:36:42,180 --> 00:36:46,914
[eerie music]

629
00:36:59,247 --> 00:37:00,727
<i>Sasuke?</i>

630
00:37:02,660 --> 00:37:04,930
<i>No... who is he?</i>

631
00:37:06,553 --> 00:37:09,033
<i>The same Sharingan as Sasuke's.</i>

632
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:14,612
Huh. Hard to believe that such
a child carries a nine-tailed fox.

633
00:37:16,622 --> 00:37:19,442
How does this guy know about the
nine-tailed fox?

634
00:37:22,021 --> 00:37:24,553
Naruto, you're coming with us.

635
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,320
It's him!

636
00:37:33,534 --> 00:37:34,534
He's here!

637
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:37,500
Why don't we take a walk?

638
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:42,336
These guys look like the real deal.

639
00:37:46,514 --> 00:37:48,523
Hey, Itachi.

640
00:37:48,770 --> 00:37:51,560
It'll be a pain in the neck if this kid
makes a run for it.

641
00:37:52,090 --> 00:37:55,600
Maybe I oughta... chop off a leg,
just in case.

642
00:37:56,945 --> 00:37:58,320
Say what?

643
00:37:59,410 --> 00:38:00,410
Right.

644
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:15,320
It's been a long time, hm?

645
00:38:19,224 --> 00:38:20,224
Sasuke.

646
00:38:21,410 --> 00:38:22,410
Itachi.

647
00:38:22,650 --> 00:38:23,650
Uchiha.

648
00:38:24,625 --> 00:38:26,683
I hope you're ready... 

649
00:38:27,305 --> 00:38:28,325
To die!

650
00:38:29,766 --> 00:38:32,346
Well, the Sharingan.

651
00:38:32,370 --> 00:38:34,374
Itachi, Who is this kid?

652
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:36,170
He's my younger brother.

653
00:38:37,883 --> 00:38:40,042
That's strange, cause
the way I heard it, the

654
00:38:40,043 --> 00:38:43,591
whole Uchiha clan
was wiped out... by you.

655
00:38:44,892 --> 00:38:46,852
This is who he was talking about.

656
00:38:47,201 --> 00:38:49,200
The one he wanted to kill.

657
00:38:54,596 --> 00:38:56,431
It's just as you said, brother.

658
00:38:56,455 --> 00:38:59,216
I've fostered my hatred for you.

659
00:38:59,241 --> 00:39:03,461
All this time, I've lived my life for one
single purpose.

660
00:39:04,895 --> 00:39:06,917
To kill you!

661
00:39:06,942 --> 00:39:08,382
It ends here!

662
00:39:09,285 --> 00:39:13,624
[yells]

663
00:39:25,121 --> 00:39:27,121
[bone breaks]
[screams]

664
00:39:28,546 --> 00:39:29,546
Sasuke!

665
00:39:29,570 --> 00:39:30,570
Damn!

666
00:39:31,330 --> 00:39:32,710
Forget the legs.

667
00:39:33,030 --> 00:39:36,399
Maybe I oughta start off with those arms
of his.

668
00:39:45,806 --> 00:39:46,806
Master Jiraiya.

669
00:39:47,590 --> 00:39:49,538
I know he's the one you're really after.

670
00:39:49,950 --> 00:39:50,950
You're right.

671
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:54,190
Naruto is the prize that the Akatsuki are
after.

672
00:39:54,970 --> 00:39:56,579
And we will have him.

673
00:39:56,563 --> 00:39:57,563
Huh?

674
00:40:02,040 --> 00:40:04,326
No way you're getting Naruto.

675
00:40:05,020 --> 00:40:06,501
We'll see about that.

676
00:40:08,290 --> 00:40:10,364
Actually, this is all very convenient.

677
00:40:10,390 --> 00:40:13,151
I can eliminate you both at the same time.

678
00:40:13,176 --> 00:40:14,196
Stay out of this!

679
00:40:21,347 --> 00:40:23,425
The only one...

680
00:40:23,449 --> 00:40:25,733
Who's going to eliminate him...

681
00:40:27,394 --> 00:40:29,104
Is me!

682
00:40:29,129 --> 00:40:30,129
Go away.

683
00:40:30,153 --> 00:40:32,133
You don't interest me at the moment.

684
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:34,400
Sasuke, no!

685
00:40:38,642 --> 00:40:40,262
Why you lousy!

686
00:40:40,286 --> 00:40:41,467
No, Naruto!

687
00:40:41,492 --> 00:40:42,352
Don't butt in!

688
00:40:42,376 --> 00:40:43,416
Mind your own business!

689
00:40:45,700 --> 00:40:46,740
Just back off!

690
00:40:46,764 --> 00:40:47,764
This fight is mine!

691
00:40:52,796 --> 00:40:53,836
Of course.

692
00:40:53,860 --> 00:40:54,860
Revenge.

693
00:41:02,214 --> 00:41:04,106
And now, finally!

694
00:41:04,112 --> 00:41:05,393
[coughs]

695
00:41:06,073 --> 00:41:09,543
All these years... nothing has changed.

696
00:41:09,846 --> 00:41:11,266
How can it be?

697
00:41:20,090 --> 00:41:25,930
I've trained for so long... just to kill
him... for so long.

698
00:41:28,859 --> 00:41:31,639
What have I been doing all these years?

699
00:41:31,663 --> 00:41:34,083
Was it... was it all for this?

700
00:41:43,894 --> 00:41:45,514
You're weak, Sasuke.

701
00:41:46,802 --> 00:41:49,665
And for the next 24 hours...

702
00:41:49,689 --> 00:41:51,402
Relive that day.

703
00:42:00,208 --> 00:42:02,744
That does it! I'm
through standing around!

704
00:42:02,757 --> 00:42:04,757
Hraaaah!

705
00:42:11,400 --> 00:42:12,400
Ninja Art.

706
00:42:12,780 --> 00:42:13,780
Toadmouth Trap.

707
00:42:14,770 --> 00:42:17,982
Too bad for you, Itachi... Kisame.

708
00:42:21,970 --> 00:42:24,960
You've both just been swallowed by the
Mountain Toad.

709
00:42:25,300 --> 00:42:29,140
This Toad has a sensitive digestive tract,
so don't upset him.

710
00:42:30,190 --> 00:42:33,380
It must be humbling to know that you've
been reduced to Toad bait.

711
00:42:37,670 --> 00:42:39,160
You're still too weak.

712
00:42:39,885 --> 00:42:41,510
You don't have enough hate.

713
00:42:42,300 --> 00:42:43,300
You never will.

714
00:42:43,670 --> 00:42:45,020
Kisame, come.

715
00:42:46,556 --> 00:42:47,556
Stop!

716
00:42:48,452 --> 00:42:49,452
He's getting away!

717
00:42:49,785 --> 00:42:53,956
A ninja hasn't been born yet who can
survive this powerful stomach.

718
00:42:55,961 --> 00:42:56,961
Huh?

719
00:42:59,885 --> 00:43:00,887
Hey!

720
00:43:00,912 --> 00:43:01,912
Pervy Sage!

721
00:43:03,887 --> 00:43:05,447
What the heck happened?

722
00:43:08,647 --> 00:43:10,247
They both got away!

723
00:43:15,685 --> 00:43:17,345
<i>He did the impossible.</i>

724
00:43:18,194 --> 00:43:19,774
<i>He broke through the wall.</i>

725
00:43:24,252 --> 00:43:26,332
So we just run away again?

726
00:43:27,015 --> 00:43:28,455
We do a lot of that.

727
00:43:29,219 --> 00:43:32,399
There's no rush for now. We'll
get Naruto when the time is right.

728
00:43:33,201 --> 00:43:35,795
Besides, I felt it wise
for us to find some

729
00:43:35,819 --> 00:43:38,944
place to rest for a while
and recharge my powers.

730
00:43:42,757 --> 00:43:45,652
On top of Tsukuyomi,
to have to use Amatarasu

731
00:43:45,653 --> 00:43:48,981
as well... It was more
exhausting than I thought.

732
00:43:59,386 --> 00:44:01,426
What is this stuff anyway?

733
00:44:01,816 --> 00:44:03,266
Some kind of black fire?

734
00:44:03,290 --> 00:44:05,190
Stay away from it!
Ahh!

735
00:44:08,637 --> 00:44:10,477
How did they do it?

736
00:44:10,611 --> 00:44:12,471
What did they use to escape?

737
00:44:13,245 --> 00:44:15,285
And these black flames?

738
00:44:15,959 --> 00:44:20,039
To burn the stone toad when it has the
power to spit fire itself?

739
00:44:20,765 --> 00:44:22,845
That is strong jutsu indeed.

740
00:44:26,154 --> 00:44:27,154
Huh?

741
00:44:35,478 --> 00:44:36,478
There.

742
00:44:37,933 --> 00:44:39,771
Sealing jutsu!

743
00:44:39,796 --> 00:44:41,395
Fire seal now!

744
00:45:00,506 --> 00:45:05,928
<seal>

745
00:45:09,170 --> 00:45:09,970
Alright.

746
00:45:11,223 --> 00:45:13,883
Well that takes care of that for the time
being.

747
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:15,320
Now for Sasuke.

748
00:45:20,769 --> 00:45:21,769
Sasuke!

749
00:45:44,790 --> 00:45:46,410
What did he do to him?

750
00:45:51,949 --> 00:45:54,083
DYNAMIC

751
00:45:54,107 --> 00:45:56,737
Guy?
ENTRY!

752
00:45:57,942 --> 00:45:59,739
Ha ha ha ha ha ha...

753
00:46:00,811 --> 00:46:02,010
Oh!

754
00:46:07,153 --> 00:46:11,209
Heheh... I-I guess I was
a little over enthusiastic, uh

755
00:46:11,730 --> 00:46:15,039
You see, I... I was trying to hurry and I
couldn't see very clearly.

756
00:46:15,036 --> 00:46:16,685
Ha ha ha ha ha! Ehh...

757
00:46:16,710 --> 00:46:21,370
Using my headband to peer into the
opening, all I could see were two sinister

758
00:46:21,371 --> 00:46:24,970
figures, so... I'm gonna
put an end to this right now!

759
00:46:25,710 --> 00:46:26,970
Do you know what?

760
00:46:27,110 --> 00:46:29,470
If this is your way of saying sorry,
it stinks!

761
00:46:29,495 --> 00:46:33,101
I'm sorry, but it was just a simple
misunderstanding.

762
00:46:33,126 --> 00:46:34,806
Simple-minded's more like it.

763
00:46:35,201 --> 00:46:36,601
But never mind that now.

764
00:46:36,625 --> 00:46:38,906
We've got to get Sasuke to the medical
corps at once.

765
00:46:38,930 --> 00:46:39,930
Right.

766
00:46:40,050 --> 00:46:41,330
He's badly beaten up.

767
00:46:42,030 --> 00:46:43,030
His arm is broken.

768
00:46:43,860 --> 00:46:48,190
And he's been knocked out by whatever
jutsu that was that Itachi used on him.

769
00:46:49,800 --> 00:46:52,901
Could it be the same thing he used on
Kakashi?

770
00:46:53,350 --> 00:46:54,350
Pervy Sage!

771
00:46:54,625 --> 00:46:56,886
Sasuke is gonna be alright though,
isn't he?

772
00:46:58,510 --> 00:46:59,668
Physically, yes.

773
00:46:59,693 --> 00:47:02,573
But I am worried about what may have been
done to his mind.

774
00:47:04,118 --> 00:47:05,118
What the heck?

775
00:47:05,928 --> 00:47:08,728
What did Sasuke ever do to deserve this?

776
00:47:10,250 --> 00:47:11,983
Okay, Pervy Sage.

777
00:47:12,856 --> 00:47:15,076
It's time for a new game plan.

778
00:47:15,791 --> 00:47:17,587
Starting right now!

779
00:47:18,704 --> 00:47:21,744
I admit, I let those goons scare me a
little.

780
00:47:21,768 --> 00:47:22,808
But that's over.

781
00:47:23,351 --> 00:47:24,531
No more running!

782
00:47:24,810 --> 00:47:28,542
After all, it's me they're after,
right?

783
00:47:29,315 --> 00:47:30,415
Well, okay then!

784
00:47:30,439 --> 00:47:32,199
It's time I give them what they want!

785
00:47:32,870 --> 00:47:33,870
Hmph.

786
00:47:34,204 --> 00:47:35,324
Nice speech, kid.

787
00:47:35,348 --> 00:47:37,688
But I'm afraid you wouldn't stand a chance
against them.

788
00:47:38,994 --> 00:47:40,614
You're not in the same league.

789
00:47:41,802 --> 00:47:44,802
What would have happened if I hadn't shown
up just now, huh?

790
00:47:44,942 --> 00:47:47,662
It took all I had to get them away from
you.

791
00:47:47,686 --> 00:47:48,686
Is that right?

792
00:47:49,094 --> 00:47:50,168
So what are you suggesting?

793
00:47:50,193 --> 00:47:51,498
That we just do nothing?

794
00:47:51,840 --> 00:47:53,880
Sit here waiting for them to hit us again?

795
00:47:53,904 --> 00:47:55,384
What kind of strategy is that?

796
00:47:55,570 --> 00:47:56,570
Just be quiet!

797
00:48:00,360 --> 00:48:02,179
You haven't earned the right.

798
00:48:06,750 --> 00:48:08,218
I'm sorry, Guy.

799
00:48:08,243 --> 00:48:10,763
I wanted to let Sasuke fight his own
fight.

800
00:48:12,000 --> 00:48:14,581
I see now I should have intervened sooner.

801
00:48:15,220 --> 00:48:18,790
This is obviously the same sort of jutsu
that Kakashi was hit with.

802
00:48:20,070 --> 00:48:21,730
We don't know when he'll come out of it.

803
00:48:21,988 --> 00:48:23,468
What? Kakashi-sensei?

804
00:48:32,662 --> 00:48:36,308
There's nothing worse than
seeing your students fall in battle.

805
00:48:37,530 --> 00:48:40,374
It's like losing little pieces of your
soul.

806
00:48:41,170 --> 00:48:46,787
What we need is a supreme medical specialist,
a master of healing arts, and soon.

807
00:48:47,411 --> 00:48:48,326
You're right.

808
00:48:48,424 --> 00:48:51,314
And the woman you're talking about is the
one we've come to find.

809
00:48:51,660 --> 00:48:52,660
Huh?

810
00:48:53,210 --> 00:48:54,210
The woman?

811
00:48:54,854 --> 00:48:55,854
Huh?

812
00:49:06,205 --> 00:49:07,605
You don't mean...

813
00:49:07,933 --> 00:49:08,933
Hm-hm.

814
00:49:18,122 --> 00:49:21,018
Aaaahhhhh!

815
00:49:21,101 --> 00:49:23,721
Wha- what are you going 
to do with all that cash?

816
00:49:24,070 --> 00:49:26,330
Yes, that's exactly who I mean.

817
00:49:27,207 --> 00:49:31,827
Another of the legendary Sannin,
the queen of slugs and elixirs.

818
00:49:32,652 --> 00:49:34,632
Take a good look, Shizune.

819
00:49:34,656 --> 00:49:36,812
The losing streak is over.

820
00:49:36,837 --> 00:49:38,460
Our luck is about to change!

821
00:49:38,499 --> 00:49:42,235
The gambling fool and
mistress of the healing arts...

822
00:49:42,234 --> 00:49:44,234
Lady Tsunade!

823
00:49:46,854 --> 00:49:47,974
All right, guy.

824
00:49:48,190 --> 00:49:49,794
We'll leave Sasuke in your hands.

825
00:49:55,774 --> 00:49:56,880
Master Jiraiya.

826
00:49:57,020 --> 00:49:58,020
Hm?

827
00:49:58,420 --> 00:49:59,580
Find the Lady Tsunade.

828
00:50:00,310 --> 00:50:01,310
Bring her back to us.

829
00:50:01,360 --> 00:50:02,860
Don't worry, you can count on us!

830
00:50:03,345 --> 00:50:05,332
We'll have her back in the village in no
time!

831
00:50:10,169 --> 00:50:13,759
Naruto, nothing impresses me more than
guts, kid.

832
00:50:14,060 --> 00:50:16,745
Come here, let me give you this.
Hm?

833
00:50:16,770 --> 00:50:19,054
Lee got stronger with this.

834
00:50:19,079 --> 00:50:20,102
Really? What?

835
00:50:20,127 --> 00:50:21,127
What is it?

836
00:50:28,470 --> 00:50:29,510
Check it out!

837
00:50:34,656 --> 00:50:37,078
[groans]

838
00:50:40,152 --> 00:50:42,546
It's breathable, retains
moisture, and offers complete

839
00:50:42,570 --> 00:50:46,135
complete freedom of movement
all in one sweet... package.

840
00:50:46,832 --> 00:50:49,812
If you wear it while you train,
you'll notice a difference immediately.

841
00:50:50,238 --> 00:50:52,018
They really grow on you.

842
00:50:52,130 --> 00:50:55,904
Pretty soon, you'll be wearing them all
the time, just like Lee.

843
00:50:55,928 --> 00:50:58,892
I've got a bit of a thing for them myself.

844
00:50:59,815 --> 00:51:02,785
Oh, man!

845
00:51:08,664 --> 00:51:10,987
Ugh, If you're gonna walk
around carrying that thing,

846
00:51:11,011 --> 00:51:14,469
you oughta pack a hand
mirror or two, you idiot.

847
00:51:22,295 --> 00:51:23,675
Pretty cool, huh?

848
00:51:23,860 --> 00:51:25,080
Don't even think about it.

849
00:51:25,160 --> 00:51:27,015
I mean, look at that guy.

850
00:51:27,040 --> 00:51:28,040
Huh?

851
00:51:35,914 --> 00:51:38,534
I know that he's the one you're really
after.

852
00:51:39,096 --> 00:51:40,096
You're right.

853
00:51:40,424 --> 00:51:43,464
Naruto is the prize that the Akatsuki are
after.

854
00:51:44,107 --> 00:51:45,947
And we will have him.

855
00:51:50,205 --> 00:51:51,205
Hm.

856
00:51:52,623 --> 00:51:53,623
What's up?

857
00:51:54,167 --> 00:51:55,417
So, Pervy Sage.

858
00:51:56,430 --> 00:51:58,920
What exactly do those guys want with me,
anyway?

859
00:51:59,784 --> 00:52:00,784
Hm...

860
00:52:02,460 --> 00:52:04,046
Come on out with it, Pervy Sage.

861
00:52:04,071 --> 00:52:05,555
You know, don't you?

862
00:52:10,693 --> 00:52:12,093
Don't get the wrong idea.

863
00:52:12,455 --> 00:52:13,915
It's not you they want.

864
00:52:14,829 --> 00:52:16,479
It's what's inside of you.

865
00:52:17,290 --> 00:52:19,320
What the hell is this thing, anyway?

866
00:52:22,836 --> 00:52:25,736
Some horrible demon that terrorized the
Leaf Village.

867
00:52:25,998 --> 00:52:28,178
That's why everyone's so afraid of it,
right?

868
00:52:28,522 --> 00:52:30,982
So why do these guys want it so bad?

869
00:52:34,761 --> 00:52:39,174
The nine-tailed fox has appeared in times
of consequence all through the ages,

870
00:52:39,200 --> 00:52:43,113
a ghastly spirit destroying all that lays
in its path.

871
00:52:44,001 --> 00:52:48,761
As powerful as any act of nature,
men trembled before it.

872
00:52:54,916 --> 00:52:57,946
As for what they would
want with that malicious

873
00:52:57,970 --> 00:53:00,699
monstrosity, that's a hard
question to answer, Naruto.

874
00:53:00,723 --> 00:53:02,043
I honestly can't say.

875
00:53:04,153 --> 00:53:07,805
I suppose with the Nine
Tails sealed up inside you, they

876
00:53:07,829 --> 00:53:11,796
might be thinking of somehow
seizing control of that power.

877
00:53:12,023 --> 00:53:13,383
Bending it to their will.

878
00:53:17,152 --> 00:53:21,112
It's a bitter pill to swallow knowing that
those two will be after you now.

879
00:53:21,312 --> 00:53:22,812
But that is your fate.

880
00:53:23,120 --> 00:53:26,089
Not to worry though, after all you will
have me around.

881
00:53:26,115 --> 00:53:28,785
Oh well, I'll just have to hurry up and
get stronger.

882
00:53:28,810 --> 00:53:29,810
No other choice.

883
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:31,000
Hm?

884
00:53:31,656 --> 00:53:32,656
Alright!

885
00:53:32,680 --> 00:53:35,813
Let's find the Tsunade woman
you're talking about, so she

886
00:53:35,814 --> 00:53:39,398
can fix up Sasuke and we get
down to some serious training!

887
00:53:40,895 --> 00:53:43,480
This kid's got a one-track mind.

888
00:53:48,709 --> 00:53:50,158
Ayiee!

889
00:53:50,480 --> 00:53:53,094
This place has the highest minimum in
town!

890
00:53:53,120 --> 00:53:54,860
Don't get your panties in a bunch.

891
00:53:55,140 --> 00:53:56,140
Let's do this.

892
00:53:56,580 --> 00:53:59,686
Oh, wait for me!

893
00:54:03,807 --> 00:54:05,396
Hmm...

894
00:54:05,763 --> 00:54:07,154
What now?

895
00:54:07,583 --> 00:54:11,073
This beautiful woman that you've got us
out here scouting around for.

896
00:54:11,506 --> 00:54:13,356
Is she the Tsunade that you mentioned?

897
00:54:13,551 --> 00:54:15,105
Hey! Not bad, kid.

898
00:54:15,130 --> 00:54:16,430
You're pretty sharp, aren't you?

899
00:54:16,691 --> 00:54:18,431
Why? What's on your mind then?

900
00:54:18,595 --> 00:54:21,340
Well, you said she was one of the three
legendary Sannin.

901
00:54:21,615 --> 00:54:23,578
The same as you, right, Pervy Sage?

902
00:54:23,740 --> 00:54:24,740
That's right.

903
00:54:24,920 --> 00:54:25,960
What's your point already?

904
00:54:26,916 --> 00:54:28,687
How old is she?

905
00:54:29,210 --> 00:54:30,210
Same age as me.

906
00:54:31,259 --> 00:54:33,361
Ugh, she's ancient.

907
00:54:37,585 --> 00:54:39,325
Ayieee!

908
00:54:41,548 --> 00:54:42,548
Hm?

909
00:54:42,572 --> 00:54:43,602
Wait, she's...

910
00:54:52,384 --> 00:54:53,660
Here's all my cash.

911
00:54:54,456 --> 00:54:56,476
You think I could get some chips?

912
00:55:00,133 --> 00:55:01,753
She's going all in!

913
00:55:01,860 --> 00:55:02,860
Oink!

914
00:55:07,152 --> 00:55:08,852
Looks like a pretty big spender.

915
00:55:08,966 --> 00:55:10,186
Who is this broad?

916
00:55:10,210 --> 00:55:12,190
You're kidding. You
never heard of her?

917
00:55:12,618 --> 00:55:14,998
She's the one with the crazy nickname.

918
00:55:15,240 --> 00:55:16,240
Nickname?

919
00:55:19,164 --> 00:55:21,844
So, what's this Tsunade lady like,
anyway?

920
00:55:22,196 --> 00:55:23,796
Ah, curious, are you?

921
00:55:23,820 --> 00:55:24,820
Yeah.

922
00:55:25,570 --> 00:55:27,105
What can I tell you?

923
00:55:27,818 --> 00:55:29,978
Well, for one thing, she's kind of
unpleasant.

924
00:55:30,866 --> 00:55:33,493
Plus, I guess there's
the fact that she's known

925
00:55:33,517 --> 00:55:35,614
far and wide as a
die-hard gambler and all.

926
00:55:35,638 --> 00:55:36,133
Great!

927
00:55:36,157 --> 00:55:39,296
This should be a piece of cake,
then, if she's as famous as all that.

928
00:55:39,320 --> 00:55:41,340
Oh, she's famous, all right.

929
00:55:41,480 --> 00:55:43,920
You might even call her Legendary.

930
00:55:49,316 --> 00:55:52,416
So, ah, what's this crazy nickname she's
got?

931
00:55:52,959 --> 00:55:54,259
The Legendary.

932
00:55:54,283 --> 00:55:55,804
Legendary... Huh?

933
00:56:00,117 --> 00:56:05,688
Ha ha ha ha ha... Ha ha
ha ha ha... Ha ha ha ha ha...

934
00:56:11,583 --> 00:56:13,583
<i>Why are they all laughing?</i>

935
00:56:13,899 --> 00:56:15,899
Oink oink...

936
00:56:20,610 --> 00:56:23,068
The Legendary...

937
00:56:24,424 --> 00:56:26,952
Sucker!

938
00:56:28,305 --> 00:56:30,963
But as legendary a
sucker as she may be

939
00:56:30,988 --> 00:56:33,180
I doubt she's going
to be all that easy to find.

940
00:56:34,067 --> 00:56:35,848
Why? What makes you say that?

941
00:56:35,873 --> 00:56:38,452
She's not the type to grow old gracefully.

942
00:56:38,630 --> 00:56:41,750
Probably using some kind of jutsu to mask
her appearance.

943
00:56:42,530 --> 00:56:44,650
She's actually fifty
years old, but I'm sure

944
00:56:44,651 --> 00:56:47,161
she'll look more like
she did in her twenties.

945
00:56:47,485 --> 00:56:48,485
Huh?

946
00:56:48,638 --> 00:56:49,638
That's not all.

947
00:56:49,662 --> 00:56:53,496
The word on the wind I hear of late is she
started transforming on the fly,

948
00:56:53,521 --> 00:56:56,185
going from her teens to
her thirties or forties, all so

949
00:56:56,244 --> 00:56:59,295
she can cut out on any
moneylender she's in too deep with.

950
00:56:59,580 --> 00:57:00,580
That's awful!

951
00:57:00,700 --> 00:57:03,330
Aw man, she sounds like a charmer!

952
00:57:03,355 --> 00:57:06,720
Yeah, well, Tsunade's always loved
gambling more than anything.

953
00:57:07,230 --> 00:57:09,614
It's too bad she never had any luck.

954
00:57:09,830 --> 00:57:11,369
Or skill, for that matter.

955
00:57:12,320 --> 00:57:15,680
She was made a sucker so many times the
name just stuck with her.

956
00:57:15,870 --> 00:57:19,040
But then she would just borrow money and
skip out on her debts.

957
00:57:20,290 --> 00:57:22,583
Ah, it brings me back, I tell ya.

958
00:57:23,250 --> 00:57:25,152
Hey, we don't have time for nostalgia!

959
00:57:25,177 --> 00:57:26,220
What?
Come on!

960
00:57:26,221 --> 00:57:28,338
Do you have a plan for finding her or
what?

961
00:57:28,380 --> 00:57:29,954
Not exactly.

962
00:57:30,250 --> 00:57:31,979
We might have a little
work ahead of us, but

963
00:57:31,979 --> 00:57:33,970
I'm sure you and I'll
come up with something.

964
00:57:34,254 --> 00:57:39,446
So you don't even have the slightest idea
how long this is gonna take, do you?

965
00:57:39,470 --> 00:57:40,960
Not a minute will be wasted.

966
00:57:41,832 --> 00:57:42,832
Huh?

967
00:57:42,930 --> 00:57:45,860
All our time on the road will be devoted
solely to you.

968
00:57:46,880 --> 00:57:47,880
To me?

969
00:57:49,040 --> 00:57:50,340
We've gotta get you stronger.

970
00:57:51,275 --> 00:57:52,275
Time to train!

971
00:58:01,734 --> 00:58:02,734
Okay!

972
00:58:03,380 --> 00:58:04,988
Ah! Wait, wait, wait,
wait wait!

973
00:58:05,013 --> 00:58:05,740
Hold on a second!

974
00:58:05,936 --> 00:58:08,276
Look, I already told you, I'm not having
that!

975
00:58:08,300 --> 00:58:10,000
I don't want to be seen
walking around with

976
00:58:10,060 --> 00:58:12,280
someone wearing that,
that, that, that thing!

977
00:58:17,990 --> 00:58:19,010
Come on, Pervy Sage!

978
00:58:19,310 --> 00:58:20,310
What are we waiting for?

979
00:58:20,700 --> 00:58:22,010
Let's start my training already!

980
00:58:22,500 --> 00:58:24,650
All right, don't get ahead of yourself
now.

981
00:58:25,258 --> 00:58:28,364
I have to train you while we gather
information on Tsunade.

982
00:58:28,388 --> 00:58:30,868
Otherwise, it's not going to mean anything
to you.

983
00:58:31,136 --> 00:58:33,304
Huh? Gather information?

984
00:58:36,874 --> 00:58:38,294
In this town!

985
00:58:38,350 --> 00:58:40,248
Whoa!

986
00:58:42,288 --> 00:58:48,788
[overlapping voices]

987
00:58:50,951 --> 00:58:52,652
Wait up!
Hurry, hurry!

988
00:58:52,676 --> 00:58:54,996
Ah, man, this is gonna be great!

989
00:58:55,020 --> 00:58:57,620
I've never seen anything like this before
in my life!

990
00:58:58,020 --> 00:59:01,320
Downtime is important, so have a little
fun before we start your training.

991
00:59:02,002 --> 00:59:04,482
This festival will be going on for a
while.

992
00:59:04,506 --> 00:59:06,446
We'll hunker down here till it's over.

993
00:59:06,837 --> 00:59:08,837
And then we'll start your training here,
too.

994
00:59:08,861 --> 00:59:09,900
All right!

995
00:59:17,979 --> 00:59:18,979
Oh, baby!

996
00:59:19,077 --> 00:59:21,197
That is one fat frog you got!

997
00:59:21,221 --> 00:59:22,221
You're filthy rich!

998
00:59:22,320 --> 00:59:24,000
Yeah, I've got a pretty big stash!

999
00:59:24,286 --> 00:59:26,906
I've been saving up bit by
bit from my missions!

1000
00:59:27,931 --> 00:59:28,951
Catch you later!

1001
00:59:28,975 --> 00:59:30,635
Stop right there, Naruto!
Huh?

1002
00:59:30,660 --> 00:59:32,780
I'm going to hold onto your wallet for
you.

1003
00:59:33,202 --> 00:59:35,451
Hey! What do you
think you're doing?

1004
00:59:35,874 --> 00:59:36,354
Here.

1005
00:59:36,464 --> 00:59:38,124
You can have this much to spend.

1006
00:59:39,023 --> 00:59:39,543
What?

1007
00:59:39,751 --> 00:59:41,235
Only 300?

1008
00:59:41,344 --> 00:59:43,240
I don't want to hear it!

1009
00:59:43,363 --> 00:59:46,843
Honoring the shinobi's three prohibitions
is the duty of any upstanding ninja!

1010
00:59:47,268 --> 00:59:48,888
Three prohibitions?

1011
00:59:49,136 --> 00:59:50,676
What are you talking about?

1012
00:59:50,700 --> 00:59:51,360
You're kidding!

1013
00:59:51,620 --> 00:59:52,420
Don't you know?

1014
00:59:52,753 --> 00:59:55,176
The three prohibitions
are a trio of temptations

1015
00:59:55,200 --> 00:59:57,076
that will bring a
shinobi to his ruin!

1016
00:59:57,336 --> 01:00:02,156
Those three prohibitions are alcohol,
pretty women, and worst of all, money.

1017
01:00:02,180 --> 01:00:06,040
Yeah, well, none of those things really
apply to me all that much, so we're cool.

1018
01:00:06,233 --> 01:00:09,152
I mean, I'm underage, so I can't drink
yet.

1019
01:00:09,176 --> 01:00:11,096
I don't really get the whole woman thing.

1020
01:00:11,120 --> 01:00:13,190
And I worked so hard to
save all that money that

1021
01:00:13,191 --> 01:00:15,380
I really don't feel like
spending a ton of it.

1022
01:00:15,460 --> 01:00:17,275
You little fool!

1023
01:00:17,300 --> 01:00:19,092
Don't take money lightly!

1024
01:00:19,117 --> 01:00:21,176
Once you start spending, you'll never
stop!

1025
01:00:22,656 --> 01:00:25,015
Money possesses a frightful power.

1026
01:00:25,040 --> 01:00:27,141
This woman, Tsunade,
that we're searching for

1027
01:00:27,142 --> 01:00:30,213
has ruined herself
with the pursuit of it.

1028
01:00:31,391 --> 01:00:34,787
Pretty big talk coming from someone so
addicted to the ladies.

1029
01:00:34,812 --> 01:00:37,391
I'm gonna go see if I can gather some
information.

1030
01:00:37,856 --> 01:00:40,476
Here, I want you to hold onto my bag for
me, okay?

1031
01:00:40,500 --> 01:00:43,131
If you happen to get lost
somehow, you can always

1032
01:00:43,132 --> 01:00:45,481
rely on my tracker toad
to sniff out my scent.

1033
01:00:50,440 --> 01:00:53,380
Gotta keep reminding myself he's still
just a kid.

1034
01:00:54,200 --> 01:00:55,200
Last one!

1035
01:00:58,164 --> 01:00:59,263
Bullseye!

1036
01:00:59,288 --> 01:01:00,368
Right on target!

1037
01:01:02,080 --> 01:01:05,099
Well, that shuriken training wasn't for
nothing.

1038
01:01:09,300 --> 01:01:10,296
Huh?

1039
01:01:10,320 --> 01:01:11,484
Aaaaaaah!

1040
01:01:12,729 --> 01:01:14,589
Man, kid, you stink!

1041
01:01:15,262 --> 01:01:16,946
Huh. Yeah, we'll see.

1042
01:01:16,970 --> 01:01:17,970
Get a load of this.

1043
01:01:18,713 --> 01:01:20,053
Not so fast.

1044
01:01:20,144 --> 01:01:20,584
What?

1045
01:01:21,149 --> 01:01:22,365
Mm-mm-mm.

1046
01:01:22,826 --> 01:01:23,826
Mmh?

1047
01:01:23,850 --> 01:01:25,170
Attention, Shinobi.

1048
01:01:25,390 --> 01:01:26,990
Ninjutsu strictly forbidden?

1049
01:01:27,983 --> 01:01:30,004
Oh. Haha.. Hehe...

1050
01:01:30,732 --> 01:01:31,954
Thank you.

1051
01:01:36,016 --> 01:01:38,829
Careful, kid. You shouldn't
walk around with that mask on.

1052
01:01:39,170 --> 01:01:40,170
Ow!

1053
01:01:42,940 --> 01:01:43,940
Hmm?

1054
01:01:47,247 --> 01:01:50,203
Hey...
it's the Pervy Sage's checkbook.

1055
01:01:50,833 --> 01:01:54,053
One... ten... one hundred...

1056
01:01:55,577 --> 01:01:58,165
L-Look at all those zeros!

1057
01:01:58,459 --> 01:01:59,059
Geez!

1058
01:01:59,083 --> 01:02:03,022
He should be treating me right now if he's
this loaded for crying out loud!

1059
01:02:03,433 --> 01:02:04,713
Cheap old geezer!

1060
01:02:08,969 --> 01:02:10,109
Not much left.

1061
01:02:10,463 --> 01:02:12,923
One more stand and that'll be it for the
day.

1062
01:02:15,862 --> 01:02:17,462
We've gotta get you stronger.

1063
01:02:18,258 --> 01:02:19,358
Time to train!

1064
01:02:19,810 --> 01:02:20,810
Hmph.

1065
01:02:21,269 --> 01:02:21,930
Hmph.

1066
01:02:22,150 --> 01:02:23,530
Hey, how's it going?

1067
01:02:23,830 --> 01:02:26,197
I'd like to get two grilled squid,
please.

1068
01:02:26,222 --> 01:02:29,121
Oh, and, uh, make one of those big enough
for a grown-up.

1069
01:02:29,145 --> 01:02:30,205
Okay, coming up.

1070
01:02:30,662 --> 01:02:32,282
Got sent in a squid run, huh?

1071
01:02:32,306 --> 01:02:34,906
Tell you what, I'll throw in the kid's
size for free.

1072
01:02:34,930 --> 01:02:35,930
Thanks a lot, mister!

1073
01:02:36,170 --> 01:02:37,170
You're the man!

1074
01:02:37,270 --> 01:02:38,550
Oh, you think so, huh?

1075
01:02:38,750 --> 01:02:41,418
Well, you're getting half price on that
other squid, too.

1076
01:02:41,443 --> 01:02:42,963
Wow! Thanks!

1077
01:02:44,570 --> 01:02:45,826
Good grief.

1078
01:02:45,851 --> 01:02:47,609
Where did he run off to?

1079
01:02:48,400 --> 01:02:50,186
Yahaha haha!

1080
01:02:50,210 --> 01:02:50,650
Huh?

1081
01:02:51,037 --> 01:02:52,549
Was that Pervy Sage?

1082
01:02:53,802 --> 01:02:54,802
Hmm?

1083
01:02:54,826 --> 01:02:55,957
Ha ha ha!

1084
01:02:55,982 --> 01:02:58,182
What can I say?
I love the ladies!

1085
01:02:58,655 --> 01:03:00,070
Oh. Hey, kid.

1086
01:03:00,462 --> 01:03:02,482
Had your fill of the festival already,
huh?

1087
01:03:03,080 --> 01:03:04,279
[slurps]

1088
01:03:12,970 --> 01:03:14,200
I need a refresher!

1089
01:03:14,360 --> 01:03:16,895
What were those prohibitions of yours
again?

1090
01:03:16,920 --> 01:03:18,180
What's the matter with you?

1091
01:03:18,260 --> 01:03:20,543
You're breaking all three in
one go, you dirty...

1092
01:03:20,568 --> 01:03:22,125
Uh... Wait! Naruto!

1093
01:03:22,149 --> 01:03:25,243
Wait, schmait! I can't believe
you squandered all my

1094
01:03:23,496 --> 01:03:24,896
<i>Naruto stop!</i>

1095
01:03:24,916 --> 01:03:26,416
<i>I'll get it all back, I promise!</i>

1096
01:03:25,269 --> 01:03:26,603
hard earned savings!

1097
01:03:26,600 --> 01:03:28,200
<i>I'm sorry! Please!</i>

1098
01:03:27,341 --> 01:03:28,975
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

1099
01:03:29,000 --> 01:03:30,240
<i>Not the face! Ouch!</i>

1100
01:03:30,672 --> 01:03:31,739
Lousy good-for-nothing!

1101
01:03:32,687 --> 01:03:36,351
Look at my froggy!
It's flat as a pancake!

1102
01:03:36,512 --> 01:03:37,512
Watch it!

1103
01:03:37,895 --> 01:03:39,295
Look what you did, you little punk!

1104
01:03:42,237 --> 01:03:42,866
Huh?

1105
01:03:42,890 --> 01:03:46,417
You stained the boss's brand-new designer
suit, you street rat!

1106
01:03:46,884 --> 01:03:47,974
You're paying for that!

1107
01:03:47,998 --> 01:03:49,238
A hundred thousand large!

1108
01:03:49,898 --> 01:03:53,457
What? You're telling me that
suit cost a hundred thousand?!

1109
01:03:53,481 --> 01:03:55,509
That seems a little bit
of a stretch, fellas

1110
01:03:55,534 --> 01:03:58,776
You expect us to believe that monkey suit
is worth a hundred thousand?

1111
01:03:59,087 --> 01:04:00,863
You looking for trouble, old man?

1112
01:04:00,929 --> 01:04:02,976
You'll shut your yap if you know it's good
for you.

1113
01:04:03,401 --> 01:04:06,396
The boss used to be a Chunin from the
hidden village of the stones!

1114
01:04:06,420 --> 01:04:09,520
The legendary dark ninja, feared across
the land!

1115
01:04:10,247 --> 01:04:11,231
Ah!

1116
01:04:11,256 --> 01:04:12,436
This I gotta hear!

1117
01:04:12,460 --> 01:04:13,800
The legendary what now?

1118
01:04:13,824 --> 01:04:15,618
You're asking for it, pal!

1119
01:04:15,643 --> 01:04:16,948
Just keep pushing!

1120
01:04:17,701 --> 01:04:19,311
Naruto?
Huh?

1121
01:04:19,414 --> 01:04:20,934
This is perfect timing.

1122
01:04:20,958 --> 01:04:23,198
I have a new jutsu I want to show you.

1123
01:04:23,394 --> 01:04:24,873
Now, pay attention.

1124
01:04:26,140 --> 01:04:27,914
Enough already!

1125
01:04:36,200 --> 01:04:38,160
That was awesome!

1126
01:04:43,351 --> 01:04:45,004
And I was holding back.

1127
01:04:45,028 --> 01:04:47,088
Oh, you guys are hardly worth the trouble.

1128
01:04:52,400 --> 01:04:53,400
Wait a minute!

1129
01:04:53,890 --> 01:04:56,032
You're... the legendary...

1130
01:04:56,056 --> 01:04:59,501
Sorry about that. I guess we
kind of messed up your stand.

1131
01:05:00,229 --> 01:05:01,231
Here!

1132
01:05:01,256 --> 01:05:02,395
This should cover it.

1133
01:05:02,420 --> 01:05:03,940
Ah! Thanks a lot!

1134
01:05:05,320 --> 01:05:06,420
Now then, my good man.

1135
01:05:06,640 --> 01:05:09,720
I'd like to buy every balloon you've got,
including water balloons.

1136
01:05:09,860 --> 01:05:10,860
How's that sound?

1137
01:05:11,190 --> 01:05:12,460
Fine by me, I guess.

1138
01:05:12,780 --> 01:05:14,101
... ...

1139
01:05:16,070 --> 01:05:17,960
That was no ordinary hand move.

1140
01:05:18,516 --> 01:05:21,176
What the heck kind of jutsu was that?

1141
01:05:21,559 --> 01:05:22,967
Naruto!
Huh?

1142
01:05:23,387 --> 01:05:24,387
Let's get going.

1143
01:05:24,660 --> 01:05:25,835
Time for you to train.

1144
01:05:26,842 --> 01:05:27,842
Yes, sir!

1145
01:05:36,369 --> 01:05:37,369
Alright!

1146
01:05:37,394 --> 01:05:39,516
It's finally time to get down to business!

1147
01:05:39,776 --> 01:05:41,894
Here you go. Have
a water balloon.

1148
01:05:42,044 --> 01:05:44,156
Huh? What the heck is this for?

1149
01:05:44,180 --> 01:05:45,700
Just think about it.

1150
01:05:45,915 --> 01:05:47,875
You saw the jutsu I performed,
right?

1151
01:05:48,301 --> 01:05:49,311
Uh-huh.

1152
01:05:49,336 --> 01:05:51,236
And how would you describe it?

1153
01:05:51,860 --> 01:05:52,860
Hmm...

1154
01:05:53,117 --> 01:05:55,657
You sent that guy spinning like a
pinwheel.

1155
01:05:55,865 --> 01:05:57,605
Ah, he's not quite getting it.

1156
01:05:57,917 --> 01:05:59,137
But I've got an idea.

1157
01:06:00,235 --> 01:06:01,895
Good! Spinning!

1158
01:06:02,103 --> 01:06:03,103
There you go!

1159
01:06:03,360 --> 01:06:07,687
He's spinning the water in that balloon
without even moving his hand!

1160
01:06:10,566 --> 01:06:11,566
Whoa!

1161
01:06:12,140 --> 01:06:16,507
With the tree-climbing exercise,
you learn to gather and maintain chakra.

1162
01:06:16,936 --> 01:06:21,056
With the water-walking exercise, you
learn to release a steady amount of it.

1163
01:06:21,419 --> 01:06:23,599
Both of these you've mastered,
correct?

1164
01:06:24,796 --> 01:06:28,876
With the water-balloon exercise,
you'll learn to create a stream of chakra.

1165
01:06:28,900 --> 01:06:30,740
Spinning it, as you so aptly put it.

1166
01:06:32,448 --> 01:06:34,755
I'm supposed to create a stream of chakra?

1167
01:06:34,976 --> 01:06:37,821
Don't worry. I'll go into more
detail on how the jutsu works

1168
01:06:37,846 --> 01:06:40,716
once you've gotten
a handle of the basics.

1169
01:06:40,900 --> 01:06:44,620
First, gather the chakra in your hand
using the tree-climbing technique.

1170
01:06:45,213 --> 01:06:49,313
Then, release a steady stream of it using
the walk-on-water technique.

1171
01:06:49,612 --> 01:06:54,152
And finally, use the chakra to push and
churn the water inside of the balloon.

1172
01:06:54,636 --> 01:06:56,616
Wait a second! I get it!

1173
01:06:56,641 --> 01:06:58,818
So what you're aiming
for then is to spin the

1174
01:06:58,842 --> 01:07:02,025
water inside the balloon
until it eventually pops!

1175
01:07:02,236 --> 01:07:05,475
Atta boy! You're starting
to catch on quicker!

1176
01:07:05,500 --> 01:07:08,895
Okay! We'll train until
the sun goes down!

1177
01:07:08,920 --> 01:07:09,920
Yes, sir!

1178
01:07:18,212 --> 01:07:19,219
Hah.

1179
01:07:18,260 --> 01:07:18,260
Huh.

1180
01:07:19,234 --> 01:07:21,592
I wonder if Naruto's got what it takes.

1181
01:07:21,616 --> 01:07:23,696
I can't wait to see what happens.

1182
01:07:23,778 --> 01:07:25,038
What's cooking, good-looking?

1183
01:07:25,635 --> 01:07:27,395
Are you the guy we've heard about?

1184
01:07:27,516 --> 01:07:29,856
The one doing research on pretty girls?

1185
01:07:29,977 --> 01:07:32,415
Yeah! That's right,
you've heard of me?

1186
01:07:32,440 --> 01:07:34,520
We'd be glad to help you with your
research.

1187
01:07:34,820 --> 01:07:36,620
Buy us dinner, we'll stamp your card.

1188
01:07:36,882 --> 01:07:38,762
When the card's full, we'll tell you
everything.

1189
01:07:39,100 --> 01:07:41,056
Woo-hoo! Sounds like fun!

1190
01:07:41,081 --> 01:07:42,261
What's your name, sweetie?

1191
01:07:42,542 --> 01:07:44,958
Uh-uh. Dinner first.

1192
01:07:59,370 --> 01:08:00,850
Leave him alone now, Whiskers.

1193
01:08:00,870 --> 01:08:01,870
Come on down.

1194
01:08:03,800 --> 01:08:04,800
Excuse me.

1195
01:08:05,155 --> 01:08:06,155
Which way's the restroom?

1196
01:08:13,520 --> 01:08:16,134
Okay! Here we go, Naruto!

1197
01:08:16,160 --> 01:08:18,739
You're gonna nail this thing today!

1198
01:08:23,870 --> 01:08:26,543
Come on and burst, you stupid balloon!

1199
01:08:29,290 --> 01:08:30,657
Nothing!

1200
01:08:30,682 --> 01:08:32,320
What do I gotta do?

1201
01:08:38,642 --> 01:08:41,116
I just love your hair, Jiraiya.

1202
01:08:41,140 --> 01:08:42,640
Is that its real color?

1203
01:08:42,756 --> 01:08:44,681
Hahahaha!

1204
01:08:44,706 --> 01:08:46,965
Darling, everything about me is real!

1205
01:08:46,990 --> 01:08:48,708
Hahahaha!

1206
01:08:51,165 --> 01:08:52,490
Aaaaah!

1207
01:08:53,285 --> 01:08:54,551
Aaaaah!

1208
01:08:54,770 --> 01:08:56,714
Give me a break!

1209
01:08:58,257 --> 01:09:01,103
<i>It's been three
days! And nothing!</i>

1210
01:09:01,128 --> 01:09:03,028
<i>It stretches, but it won't burst!</i>

1211
01:09:03,689 --> 01:09:06,664
Rotating it to the left doesn't make any
difference!

1212
01:09:07,418 --> 01:09:10,418
That dang pervy sage knows something I
don't!

1213
01:09:10,442 --> 01:09:11,446
But what?

1214
01:09:11,470 --> 01:09:12,470
Hahahaha!

1215
01:09:15,046 --> 01:09:16,406
Man, oh man!

1216
01:09:16,508 --> 01:09:18,088
I just love this town!

1217
01:09:18,249 --> 01:09:21,541
Hahahaha!

1218
01:09:30,400 --> 01:09:31,899
What the...

1219
01:09:36,610 --> 01:09:37,760
Yuck!

1220
01:09:38,300 --> 01:09:40,859
He could seriously use some mouthwash!

1221
01:09:43,232 --> 01:09:44,920
Okay! Gotta build
up my strength!

1222
01:09:47,495 --> 01:09:48,495
Huh?

1223
01:09:51,042 --> 01:09:53,221
Wha... What's wrong with me?

1224
01:09:57,305 --> 01:09:59,337
Come on!

1225
01:09:59,880 --> 01:10:02,300
Great! Now I'm having
a nervous breakdown!

1226
01:10:02,325 --> 01:10:03,821
That's all I need!

1227
01:10:12,922 --> 01:10:16,227
With a little effort, even a slow learner
can get this one.

1228
01:10:16,251 --> 01:10:17,811
I know that you can do it.

1229
01:10:19,136 --> 01:10:22,761
He said there were no complicated hand
signs to learn.

1230
01:10:37,156 --> 01:10:39,536
Huh? Hey! Leave that alone!

1231
01:10:39,560 --> 01:10:40,560
It's not a toy!

1232
01:10:52,468 --> 01:10:53,468
That's it!

1233
01:10:58,017 --> 01:11:00,057
Rise and shine, pervy sage!

1234
01:11:00,081 --> 01:11:02,525
Come on! Drag those
old bones out of bed!

1235
01:11:02,770 --> 01:11:04,797
Oh... good.

1236
01:11:04,871 --> 01:11:08,299
Since you're here, bring me some water,
would ya?

1237
01:11:08,368 --> 01:11:09,368
Some water?

1238
01:11:10,240 --> 01:11:11,240
Hmph!

1239
01:11:15,010 --> 01:11:16,010
Yuck!

1240
01:11:16,950 --> 01:11:19,130
So, that's the first phase of training.

1241
01:11:19,350 --> 01:11:20,350
What's next?

1242
01:11:21,670 --> 01:11:23,147
Oh, you did it, huh?

1243
01:11:24,080 --> 01:11:26,838
Would you mind giving me a little
demonstration?

1244
01:11:27,080 --> 01:11:28,080
Watch carefully!

1245
01:11:28,583 --> 01:11:30,769
Keep your eyes on the balloon!

1246
01:11:31,183 --> 01:11:33,058
Hnggggg...

1247
01:11:33,083 --> 01:11:34,610
Interesting...

1248
01:11:35,586 --> 01:11:36,586
Haa!

1249
01:11:53,229 --> 01:11:54,456
There, old man!

1250
01:11:54,480 --> 01:11:56,240
What'd you think of that, huh?

1251
01:11:56,264 --> 01:11:57,640
[snoring]

1252
01:11:57,665 --> 01:11:58,965
Wha... huh... you...

1253
01:11:59,260 --> 01:12:01,861
Gaaaaaah!

1254
01:12:04,407 --> 01:12:07,078
Sorry about that. I've just
been working day and night.

1255
01:12:07,103 --> 01:12:08,450
You know, doing research.

1256
01:12:09,458 --> 01:12:10,576
<i>Research, huh?</i>

1257
01:12:10,605 --> 01:12:11,905
<i>Is that what you call it?</i>

1258
01:12:13,290 --> 01:12:15,290
[slurps]

1259
01:12:15,874 --> 01:12:17,474
Gotta hand it to him.

1260
01:12:17,498 --> 01:12:18,878
He found a way to do it.

1261
01:12:18,995 --> 01:12:22,755
By steadying it with his left hand and
applying chakra with his right.

1262
01:12:22,897 --> 01:12:26,292
It's a weird idea, but then, hey,
he's a weird kid.

1263
01:12:26,497 --> 01:12:29,536
And weird isn't necessarily bad.

1264
01:12:30,353 --> 01:12:31,452
[chuckles]

1265
01:12:31,476 --> 01:12:33,656
Looks like you did
it. Good for you.

1266
01:12:34,039 --> 01:12:37,119
I guess that little tip I gave you helped
out after all.

1267
01:12:37,387 --> 01:12:38,438
[meow]

1268
01:12:38,462 --> 01:12:41,752
Actually, I've really got him to thank.

1269
01:12:42,821 --> 01:12:43,821
Huh?

1270
01:12:43,930 --> 01:12:48,282
I was watching this guy play around with
my balloon, and I got a brilliant idea.

1271
01:12:49,390 --> 01:12:53,579
See, he kept knocking it back and forth,
which meant the water inside must be going

1272
01:12:53,604 --> 01:12:55,998
back and forth, too, in different
directions.

1273
01:12:56,171 --> 01:12:57,491
That's when it came to me!

1274
01:12:58,506 --> 01:13:00,406
And what would that be, exactly?

1275
01:13:00,724 --> 01:13:04,024
I thought back to when you were showing me
what to do that first time.

1276
01:13:04,401 --> 01:13:08,081
I remembered how bumpy the surface of the
balloon got, like it was boiling.

1277
01:13:08,622 --> 01:13:12,742
My problem was, I was making the water
rotate, but in only one direction.

1278
01:13:13,155 --> 01:13:15,875
That's why my balloon was smooth,
not bumpy like yours.

1279
01:13:16,033 --> 01:13:18,443
If it was gonna burst, I had
to get the water spinning

1280
01:13:18,467 --> 01:13:21,236
in a bunch of different
directions, bumping into itself.

1281
01:13:22,680 --> 01:13:26,781
So... Once I finally figured
that part out, the rest was easy!

1282
01:13:27,651 --> 01:13:32,471
Well, he still may not be capable of
executing it with only one hand,

1283
01:13:32,890 --> 01:13:35,930
but he found a way, and it works.

1284
01:13:36,982 --> 01:13:38,974
What can I say? I rule, huh?

1285
01:13:39,220 --> 01:13:40,220
Okay, then.

1286
01:13:40,280 --> 01:13:42,860
You have successfully completed the first
step.

1287
01:13:43,100 --> 01:13:44,100
All right!

1288
01:13:44,660 --> 01:13:46,520
Here, let me show it to you one more time.

1289
01:13:46,600 --> 01:13:47,600
Wanna see it again?

1290
01:13:49,860 --> 01:13:51,843
<i>He's used up a lot of chakra.</i>

1291
01:13:51,879 --> 01:13:55,058
<i>Can his chakra network withstand the
strain?</i>

1292
01:13:55,304 --> 01:13:57,364
<i>And it only gets harder from here.</i>

1293
01:14:01,675 --> 01:14:02,940
All right, then.

1294
01:14:03,060 --> 01:14:05,080
You ready to proceed to the second step
now?

1295
01:14:05,396 --> 01:14:06,396
Yeah!

1296
01:14:06,420 --> 01:14:07,700
Enough with the kid stuff!

1297
01:14:07,880 --> 01:14:09,980
What's next, weapons,
or... There you go.

1298
01:14:10,280 --> 01:14:11,280
Huh?

1299
01:14:12,154 --> 01:14:13,334
A rubber ball, hey!

1300
01:14:14,236 --> 01:14:16,689
Ah, come on, you're kidding me,
right?

1301
01:14:17,360 --> 01:14:19,566
Let's see if you can pop this one.

1302
01:14:23,480 --> 01:14:26,586
And let me tell you, it's a lot harder
than a water balloon.

1303
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:39,500
This is hard.

1304
01:14:39,685 --> 01:14:41,680
The first element is rotation.

1305
01:14:41,705 --> 01:14:43,645
The second element is force.

1306
01:14:44,506 --> 01:14:46,158
But this object is solid.

1307
01:14:46,550 --> 01:14:48,727
There's no water
inside, so it's far more

1308
01:14:48,728 --> 01:14:51,110
difficult to exert your
chakra rotation on it.

1309
01:14:51,285 --> 01:14:52,710
Yeah, I can see that.

1310
01:14:53,540 --> 01:14:55,330
I'll leave it to you to figure out.

1311
01:14:56,380 --> 01:14:58,790
I'll have to come up with something new
for this one.

1312
01:14:59,625 --> 01:15:03,342
And in the meanwhile, I better get back to
my research.

1313
01:15:03,690 --> 01:15:05,818
Hey, Pervy Sage, don't go away again!

1314
01:15:05,843 --> 01:15:08,021
Come on, stay and help me with my
training!

1315
01:15:08,055 --> 01:15:10,242
Don't leave me out here by myself!

1316
01:15:10,267 --> 01:15:11,505
Stop whining!

1317
01:15:12,110 --> 01:15:15,424
There's one part of this process you don't
seem to understand.

1318
01:15:16,640 --> 01:15:19,650
I said I'd be your teacher, not your
father or your best friend.

1319
01:15:19,730 --> 01:15:21,548
I'm not here to hold your hand.

1320
01:15:21,573 --> 01:15:24,412
You have to do this by yourself,
or not at all.

1321
01:15:24,780 --> 01:15:29,529
Stop being a child and learn how to stand
on your own two feet like a shinobi.

1322
01:15:29,570 --> 01:15:31,660
Uh, all right, I will.

1323
01:15:31,685 --> 01:15:36,531
I was just hoping before you go, you
could just show it to me one more time?

1324
01:15:37,565 --> 01:15:38,565
Pay me.

1325
01:15:42,850 --> 01:15:44,995
Get out of here, you greedy old skirt
chaser!

1326
01:15:45,020 --> 01:15:47,834
You're one to talk about growing up and
acting like a shinobi!

1327
01:15:47,860 --> 01:15:51,580
Why don't you act like a shinobi instead
of a pervy old bag of bones?!

1328
01:16:05,451 --> 01:16:09,457
Just like he said, this is way more
difficult than the water balloon!

1329
01:16:10,985 --> 01:16:13,931
My arms and hands are killing me!

1330
01:16:13,956 --> 01:16:17,596
Don't know how much more they can take!

1331
01:16:45,806 --> 01:16:51,119
How many days?
Doing the same thing over and over?

1332
01:16:58,117 --> 01:17:01,057
It's one of the master rank ninjutsu.

1333
01:17:01,722 --> 01:17:02,792
Stop whining.

1334
01:17:02,816 --> 01:17:04,156
I'm not holding your hand.

1335
01:17:04,526 --> 01:17:06,885
You have to do this yourself or not at
all.

1336
01:17:07,562 --> 01:17:08,562
Alright.

1337
01:17:11,878 --> 01:17:13,594
Hey, Naruto.

1338
01:17:13,620 --> 01:17:15,724
What are you doing here, pervy sage?

1339
01:17:15,750 --> 01:17:18,421
I want you to hop into town and grab me
some lunch.

1340
01:17:18,446 --> 01:17:19,496
Huh?

1341
01:17:19,520 --> 01:17:20,580
Why do I have to?

1342
01:17:20,730 --> 01:17:24,490
I'm your teacher, and a student is always
obliged to obey his teacher.

1343
01:17:25,420 --> 01:17:26,521
Grr...

1344
01:17:29,698 --> 01:17:31,278
Here you go, son.

1345
01:17:31,302 --> 01:17:32,882
Thanks... Thanks a lot.

1346
01:17:35,700 --> 01:17:36,995
<i>I'm your teacher.</i>

1347
01:17:37,314 --> 01:17:38,374
<i>Some teacher.</i>

1348
01:17:38,637 --> 01:17:39,959
<i>What's he taught me?</i>

1349
01:17:40,004 --> 01:17:41,414
<i>Nothing.</i>

1350
01:17:41,439 --> 01:17:43,948
I want one of those, Dad. Can I?
<i>Huh?</i>

1351
01:17:43,973 --> 01:17:45,944
The frozen fruit on a stick.

1352
01:17:45,969 --> 01:17:47,438
Please?

1353
01:17:51,107 --> 01:17:52,107
There you go.

1354
01:17:52,139 --> 01:17:54,330
Aww. I'm big now!

1355
01:17:54,355 --> 01:17:55,934
I can eat the whole thing myself!

1356
01:17:55,987 --> 01:17:57,452
No, we'll share.

1357
01:17:57,621 --> 01:18:00,761
Besides, what would your mother say if I
let you spoil your supper?

1358
01:18:01,185 --> 01:18:02,185
Okay.

1359
01:18:07,555 --> 01:18:10,375
Say, I was wondering...
Hm?

1360
01:18:10,400 --> 01:18:14,025
Well, um, maybe you could stick around for
a while today?

1361
01:18:14,276 --> 01:18:15,276
Help me train?

1362
01:18:15,412 --> 01:18:17,870
Sorry, no time.
I've got to go into town

1363
01:18:17,895 --> 01:18:19,155
and keep an appointment
with someone

1364
01:18:19,179 --> 01:18:20,599
who's helping me with my research.

1365
01:18:22,874 --> 01:18:25,490
It's up to you to figure out by yourself,
Naruto.

1366
01:18:26,285 --> 01:18:28,475
Otherwise, there's no 
point in even learning it 

1367
01:18:28,499 --> 01:18:29,834
for all the good it will do you.

1368
01:18:30,296 --> 01:18:32,836
I thought I made it clear three weeks ago.

1369
01:18:33,696 --> 01:18:36,016
Stop acting like a helpless child.

1370
01:18:36,426 --> 01:18:37,426
You're a ninja.

1371
01:18:43,164 --> 01:18:45,160
Haha!
Oh, sure, of course.

1372
01:18:45,220 --> 01:18:46,220
Don't worry about me.

1373
01:18:46,357 --> 01:18:47,574
I understand!

1374
01:18:47,708 --> 01:18:50,025
Forget about it. I was
just asking, that's all.

1375
01:18:50,366 --> 01:18:52,726
Go on and do whatever you have to do,
Pervy Sage.

1376
01:18:53,076 --> 01:18:54,650
No, you did that?

1377
01:18:54,675 --> 01:18:56,335
I don't think I believe you.

1378
01:18:56,360 --> 01:18:57,555
Hey! It's true!

1379
01:18:57,820 --> 01:19:00,092
Jiraiya is no liar!

1380
01:19:00,108 --> 01:19:02,030
[laughter]

1381
01:19:02,034 --> 01:19:03,034
[laughing stops suddenly]

1382
01:19:25,839 --> 01:19:27,918
<i>Ah jeez, what's the use?</i>

1383
01:19:27,986 --> 01:19:30,446
<i>It won't pop no matter how hard I try.</i>

1384
01:19:30,470 --> 01:19:34,550
<i>I'm just wasting my time, burning up
chakra for no good reason.</i>

1385
01:19:35,748 --> 01:19:37,728
<i>And this pain...</i>

1386
01:19:38,370 --> 01:19:41,760
<i>The more I try to increase the flow,
the more it hurts.</i>

1387
01:19:42,660 --> 01:19:43,941
<i>But I have to.</i>

1388
01:19:43,965 --> 01:19:46,645
<i>I have to give it all I've got,
or it'll never pop.</i>

1389
01:19:47,280 --> 01:19:49,858
<i>But what if all I've got isn't enough?</i>

1390
01:19:56,490 --> 01:19:57,526
<i>That's it!</i>

1391
01:19:57,550 --> 01:20:00,962
<i>If I can work through the
pain to generate more chakra,</i>

1392
01:20:00,987 --> 01:20:03,998
<i>and then push it right to
the limit of what I can endure...</i>

1393
01:20:06,577 --> 01:20:08,217
<i>Not enough yet!</i>

1394
01:20:08,242 --> 01:20:09,242
<i>Not yet!</i>

1395
01:20:13,424 --> 01:20:14,584
<i>Still not enough!</i>

1396
01:20:20,745 --> 01:20:21,745
Now!

1397
01:20:23,281 --> 01:20:24,461
Yeah, I've got it!

1398
01:20:24,620 --> 01:20:25,620
I've got it!

1399
01:20:36,420 --> 01:20:37,420
Well, well.

1400
01:20:37,570 --> 01:20:39,365
We seem to have made progress.

1401
01:20:39,390 --> 01:20:40,394
Hm?

1402
01:20:40,455 --> 01:20:43,951
Yeah, but I only made it spring a leak,
not burst like you did.

1403
01:20:43,977 --> 01:20:47,055
Boy, you're getting awfully picky all of a
sudden.

1404
01:20:47,080 --> 01:20:48,080
Here, want one?

1405
01:20:50,531 --> 01:20:52,871
You've come far, and all on your own.

1406
01:20:59,452 --> 01:21:00,452
It's delicious!

1407
01:21:04,097 --> 01:21:06,619
So, you ready to try a little experiment?

1408
01:21:06,710 --> 01:21:08,302
Sure! What?

1409
01:21:08,763 --> 01:21:10,083
Give me your right hand.

1410
01:21:14,514 --> 01:21:15,514
Hm?

1411
01:21:17,457 --> 01:21:18,457
Hehehe...

1412
01:21:19,090 --> 01:21:20,965
Uh, what is it?

1413
01:21:25,565 --> 01:21:26,565
Hm?

1414
01:21:28,919 --> 01:21:29,919
Take a look.

1415
01:21:31,367 --> 01:21:32,985
Hm? It's the same mark!

1416
01:21:33,495 --> 01:21:35,410
I don't get it, how's this supposed to
help?

1417
01:21:35,830 --> 01:21:37,877
You're the kind of kid
who got yelled at in the

1418
01:21:37,901 --> 01:21:40,260
Academy for a lack of
concentration, aren't ya?

1419
01:21:40,285 --> 01:21:42,773
I don't see what that has to do with this.

1420
01:21:43,493 --> 01:21:45,188
Look at this piece of paper.

1421
01:21:46,435 --> 01:21:47,447
Huh?

1422
01:21:47,880 --> 01:21:48,880
I've seen it.

1423
01:21:49,080 --> 01:21:50,080
All right.

1424
01:21:50,140 --> 01:21:54,424
Now, if you will, give it a second look.

1425
01:21:56,404 --> 01:21:57,404
Huh?

1426
01:22:03,374 --> 01:22:04,674
What am I looking at?

1427
01:22:04,933 --> 01:22:08,993
Well, I don't think it's going to help a
whole lot if I explain too much right away.

1428
01:22:09,338 --> 01:22:11,335
But the first time you
looked at this paper, your

1429
01:22:11,336 --> 01:22:14,136
eyes just glanced at the
whole thing, am I right?

1430
01:22:14,649 --> 01:22:15,649
Probably.

1431
01:22:15,935 --> 01:22:18,355
And what about the second time you looked?

1432
01:22:20,676 --> 01:22:22,894
Most likely the point in the middle?

1433
01:22:22,918 --> 01:22:23,918
Huh?

1434
01:22:24,267 --> 01:22:27,052
Any time that a person's
eyes gaze on a blank

1435
01:22:27,076 --> 01:22:29,695
sheet of paper, they
don't focus where to look.

1436
01:22:29,720 --> 01:22:31,942
The eyes just wander the page.

1437
01:22:32,943 --> 01:22:37,063
But if you put even a dot on it,
the mind is drawn there.

1438
01:22:38,188 --> 01:22:41,068
You're then concentrating on a single
point.

1439
01:22:41,911 --> 01:22:45,271
And with that focus comes spiritual
stability.

1440
01:22:47,123 --> 01:22:50,104
Letting you tap into unimaginable power.

1441
01:22:50,547 --> 01:22:51,547
Hmm...

1442
01:22:52,485 --> 01:22:56,745
When you finally broke open the hole in
the rubber ball, I'm sure you must have

1443
01:22:56,769 --> 01:23:00,608
been trying desperately to gather up the
chakra you needed in the palm of your hand.

1444
01:23:00,740 --> 01:23:01,920
Yeah, that's right!

1445
01:23:02,913 --> 01:23:06,192
When you concentrate, you draw out power.

1446
01:23:06,217 --> 01:23:10,036
But without some sort of target,
concentration can be difficult.

1447
01:23:10,427 --> 01:23:11,547
Hence that mark.

1448
01:23:11,696 --> 01:23:12,736
Now listen, Naruto.

1449
01:23:13,025 --> 01:23:16,099
From now on, when you're
storing a power in your right

1450
01:23:16,100 --> 01:23:20,061
hand, make sure that you
concentrate only on that mark.

1451
01:23:21,628 --> 01:23:22,890
Concentrate...

1452
01:23:24,163 --> 01:23:25,163
Alright!

1453
01:23:25,375 --> 01:23:27,031
I guess I can handle that!

1454
01:23:37,500 --> 01:23:38,520
I'm here, Sasuke.

1455
01:23:42,046 --> 01:23:44,046
Gyah!

1456
01:23:44,731 --> 01:23:45,931
My arms!

1457
01:23:46,432 --> 01:23:48,232
Lord Orochimaru, are you okay?

1458
01:23:49,125 --> 01:23:50,420
Quick! Your medicine!

1459
01:24:09,575 --> 01:24:11,770
[sighs] I just got back.

1460
01:24:11,794 --> 01:24:13,740
Now I have to clean the room.

1461
01:24:14,590 --> 01:24:17,143
Please be sure to take your medicine,
will you?

1462
01:24:17,831 --> 01:24:21,301
That medicine will do nothing for me,
you simpleton!

1463
01:24:21,380 --> 01:24:23,540
But I made it specifically for you.

1464
01:24:23,925 --> 01:24:25,255
It should ease your pain.

1465
01:24:25,764 --> 01:24:26,924
At least a little.

1466
01:24:27,376 --> 01:24:33,536
This burning in my arms... I never
imagined the suffering would be this great!

1467
01:24:33,560 --> 01:24:35,700
It was Sarutobi, after all.

1468
01:24:36,164 --> 01:24:37,384
The third Hokage.

1469
01:24:37,776 --> 01:24:39,555
This was his final curse.

1470
01:24:39,747 --> 01:24:41,470
Enough of your prattling!

1471
01:24:41,496 --> 01:24:43,856
Tell me, have you found the one I seek?

1472
01:24:44,172 --> 01:24:45,364
Yes.

1473
01:24:45,389 --> 01:24:48,569
The trail led to a place called
Tanzaku town.

1474
01:24:49,923 --> 01:24:51,740
Tanzaku town...

1475
01:24:55,356 --> 01:24:58,390
I see... Lest you forget.

1476
01:24:58,758 --> 01:25:01,398
Your opponent's one of the legendary
Sannin.

1477
01:25:02,089 --> 01:25:03,997
This isn't going to be easy.

1478
01:25:04,009 --> 01:25:06,009
[chuckles]

1479
01:25:07,281 --> 01:25:10,821
The best medicines are always bitter.

1480
01:25:10,952 --> 01:25:14,298
Gaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!

1481
01:25:14,366 --> 01:25:16,200
Concentrate!

1482
01:25:31,875 --> 01:25:33,620
I don't think that's gonna cut it.

1483
01:25:34,170 --> 01:25:35,170
It has to pop!

1484
01:25:41,639 --> 01:25:42,639
Concentrate!

1485
01:26:00,867 --> 01:26:04,229
Hi there! I was hoping you
could help me with something.

1486
01:26:26,263 --> 01:26:27,583
Dang it!

1487
01:26:34,467 --> 01:26:35,867
Concentrate!

1488
01:27:01,280 --> 01:27:02,280
Concentrate!

1489
01:27:10,231 --> 01:27:11,571
It's no use.

1490
01:27:24,483 --> 01:27:27,479
I thought I knew what concentration was.

1491
01:27:37,269 --> 01:27:38,694
[sighs]

1492
01:27:38,900 --> 01:27:43,646
Guh! [gasps] Aaaaaahhhh!

1493
01:27:44,372 --> 01:27:47,192
Curse you, Sarutobi!

1494
01:27:47,884 --> 01:27:49,884
Nngaaaaaah!

1495
01:27:56,491 --> 01:28:00,288
[panting]

1496
01:28:10,080 --> 01:28:11,080
All right, then.

1497
01:28:11,250 --> 01:28:13,560
I gotta go back and scrounge up some more
information.

1498
01:28:14,116 --> 01:28:16,472
What? Come on,
you just got here!

1499
01:28:16,735 --> 01:28:19,085
Sorry, kid, but I don't have any time to
waste.

1500
01:28:21,192 --> 01:28:22,760
Hey! That's it?

1501
01:28:22,785 --> 01:28:26,700
Not even a soulful little game of catch
between a pupil and his master?

1502
01:28:28,349 --> 01:28:29,810
You lousy bum!

1503
01:28:30,000 --> 01:28:31,000
Hmm?

1504
01:28:33,613 --> 01:28:35,516
Ha ha ha ha ha ha haa!

1505
01:28:35,657 --> 01:28:36,657
Strike!

1506
01:28:37,490 --> 01:28:38,700
There you go, kid.

1507
01:28:38,860 --> 01:28:39,860
Game over.

1508
01:28:39,961 --> 01:28:41,961
Nya ha ha ha ha ha ha!

1509
01:28:42,197 --> 01:28:43,857
See you around, sport!

1510
01:28:47,652 --> 01:28:48,866
Hmph!

1511
01:28:48,890 --> 01:28:50,405
Who needs that pervy sage?

1512
01:28:50,430 --> 01:28:52,950
I'll just dig in and work this out on my
own.

1513
01:28:55,840 --> 01:28:57,290
There's no other way, Naruto.

1514
01:28:58,320 --> 01:29:00,424
This training you must do alone.

1515
01:29:00,456 --> 01:29:02,654
You can attain the level
of the fourth Hokage

1516
01:29:02,655 --> 01:29:05,991
someday, but you must
grab it on your own.

1517
01:29:09,929 --> 01:29:10,929
Hmm...

1518
01:29:11,915 --> 01:29:13,624
Nope, never laid eyes on her.

1519
01:29:13,950 --> 01:29:14,950
Ah, I see.

1520
01:29:15,231 --> 01:29:17,095
Sorry to have been any trouble.

1521
01:29:17,658 --> 01:29:20,377
I know who you're talking about.
Hmm?

1522
01:29:22,205 --> 01:29:24,744
And I can tell you where she is right now,
too.

1523
01:29:25,421 --> 01:29:26,982
How about a drink, friend?

1524
01:29:27,382 --> 01:29:29,704
Heh. That's all right, thanks.

1525
01:29:29,729 --> 01:29:32,408
I made out like a bandit not too long ago.

1526
01:29:32,658 --> 01:29:34,584
Thanks to the lady.
<i>Yes</i>!

1527
01:29:34,692 --> 01:29:36,872
You are indeed the legendary sucker!

1528
01:29:37,361 --> 01:29:39,820
Hmm... She lost again, did she?

1529
01:29:39,845 --> 01:29:41,010
Lovely.

1530
01:29:41,487 --> 01:29:45,925
Her losses were really piling up, so
she went looking for a change of scenery.

1531
01:29:46,360 --> 01:29:47,360
Where to?

1532
01:29:53,597 --> 01:29:57,204
Seven... Seven... Seven...

1533
01:29:57,697 --> 01:30:03,714
Seven... Seven... Seven...
Seven... Seven...

1534
01:30:03,745 --> 01:30:05,323
Seven... Seven...

1535
01:30:05,912 --> 01:30:06,912
Oh!

1536
01:30:06,936 --> 01:30:08,485
Jackpot!

1537
01:30:10,134 --> 01:30:15,411
Congratulations to our lucky customer,
machine number 44 just caught the fever!

1538
01:30:15,529 --> 01:30:18,224
Don't stop now, keep that flutter coming!

1539
01:30:18,250 --> 01:30:20,564
And to every life a little luck must fall!

1540
01:30:20,590 --> 01:30:22,008
Isn't that right, milady?

1541
01:30:23,190 --> 01:30:25,290
<i>I got three sevens?</i>

1542
01:30:28,913 --> 01:30:31,093
<i>I'm getting a bad feeling here.</i>

1543
01:30:32,509 --> 01:30:35,439
I have a little knowledge of Lady Tsunade
myself.

1544
01:30:36,753 --> 01:30:39,833
I was a member of the Medical Corps after
all.

1545
01:30:40,446 --> 01:30:44,006
She was the first to propose what's now a
very common practice.

1546
01:30:44,334 --> 01:30:47,374
For each squad to have a medical
specialist included.

1547
01:30:47,660 --> 01:30:48,660
Simple but brilliant.

1548
01:30:50,437 --> 01:30:52,542
It was a landmark idea.

1549
01:30:52,676 --> 01:30:54,651
What becomes of a squad
on the battlefield with

1550
01:30:54,676 --> 01:30:57,913
no one to administer
emergency medical treatment?

1551
01:30:58,195 --> 01:31:00,815
The answer is clearer than a fire in the
night.

1552
01:31:03,900 --> 01:31:06,263
Countless years on the
battlefield have simply

1553
01:31:06,288 --> 01:31:09,318
taught them how to cope
with the ravages of war.

1554
01:31:10,605 --> 01:31:14,665
All those who were sacrificed led to the
method you speak of.

1555
01:31:15,522 --> 01:31:17,421
And one only truly
grasps the value of

1556
01:31:17,445 --> 01:31:21,109
something once it has
been taken away from you.

1557
01:31:21,392 --> 01:31:28,100
This revolutionary idea, enacted by one of
the legendary Sanin, hailed for her

1558
01:31:28,101 --> 01:31:33,571
medical prowess, spawned in that
sacrifice.

1559
01:32:11,577 --> 01:32:12,577
Hey!

1560
01:32:12,601 --> 01:32:14,337
We're still in class here!

1561
01:32:17,349 --> 01:32:19,099
You foolish runt!

1562
01:32:23,280 --> 01:32:27,970
You guys don't have a single ounce of
concentration between the four of you!

1563
01:32:27,996 --> 01:32:31,616
You are all far from the path to becoming
excellent shinobi!

1564
01:32:31,640 --> 01:32:34,678
Sorry, but I wasn't made to sit still at a
desk.

1565
01:32:35,055 --> 01:32:36,475
Right, Akamaru?

1566
01:32:36,966 --> 01:32:38,016
[barks in agreement]

1567
01:32:38,017 --> 01:32:39,359
[yawn]

1568
01:32:39,383 --> 01:32:40,674
Man, I'm hungry.

1569
01:32:40,699 --> 01:32:43,105
Sensei, is this lecture almost done?

1570
01:32:44,714 --> 01:32:47,260
Why, you... you, you, you, you little...

1571
01:32:48,198 --> 01:32:52,180
From now on, you guys are staying after
school to work on your concentration!

1572
01:32:52,347 --> 01:32:54,347
[collective groan]

1573
01:32:58,425 --> 01:32:59,680
What's this for?

1574
01:33:00,852 --> 01:33:02,982
You're about to take up a
custom passed down through

1575
01:33:03,007 --> 01:33:06,891
generations of the Hidden Leaf
Village for sharpening the mind.

1576
01:33:08,686 --> 01:33:11,432
By concentrating all your
energy on the leaf on your

1577
01:33:11,433 --> 01:33:14,487
foreheads, you will learn
to build up your chakra.

1578
01:33:14,760 --> 01:33:17,370
It is an ancient wisdom.

1579
01:33:17,396 --> 01:33:21,516
By focusing on that single leaf,
nothing can distract you.

1580
01:33:22,688 --> 01:33:26,254
He who hones his concentration is truly a
great ninja.

1581
01:33:26,280 --> 01:33:29,880
This is the origin of the leaf symbol that
we wear.

1582
01:33:30,441 --> 01:33:31,761
Quit pulling our leg!

1583
01:33:32,016 --> 01:33:35,375
You sure you didn't just make that story
up to get us to work harder?

1584
01:33:35,400 --> 01:33:36,780
No, I'm not making it up!

1585
01:33:36,900 --> 01:33:37,900
It was all true!

1586
01:33:38,100 --> 01:33:41,771
Anyway, you can't become a great ninja
just by polishing your concentration.

1587
01:33:41,796 --> 01:33:45,936
Besides, everyone knows if you want to be
an awesome ninja, you gotta be strong!

1588
01:33:45,979 --> 01:33:47,134
He does have a point.

1589
01:33:47,456 --> 01:33:48,616
Stuff like this?

1590
01:33:50,620 --> 01:33:52,700
Catch you later, Sensei!

1591
01:33:52,840 --> 01:33:55,040
Hey, you boys, wait a minute!

1592
01:33:55,360 --> 01:33:56,120
As if!

1593
01:33:56,320 --> 01:33:57,460
No time, sorry!

1594
01:33:59,308 --> 01:34:02,572
You ungrateful little misfits!

1595
01:34:06,100 --> 01:34:07,460
This is the same thing.

1596
01:34:10,037 --> 01:34:14,337
I should have paid more attention to what
Iruka Sensei was telling us.

1597
01:34:14,949 --> 01:34:15,949
I'm so stupid.

1598
01:34:20,570 --> 01:34:24,263
Well, I guess there's no use crying over
spilled milk.

1599
01:34:29,140 --> 01:34:31,417
Alright, here we go.

1600
01:34:31,510 --> 01:34:33,146
I'm doing this no matter what!

1601
01:34:39,579 --> 01:34:42,085
Concentrate, concentrate...

1602
01:34:45,350 --> 01:34:46,554
Wow!

1603
01:34:46,580 --> 01:34:49,939
Tanzaku Castle sure does have a commanding
presence!

1604
01:34:50,277 --> 01:34:54,341
Oh, they didn't designate it a cultural
landmark for nothing, I suppose.

1605
01:34:55,370 --> 01:34:57,339
Stop lollygagging around.

1606
01:34:57,427 --> 01:34:58,867
We have to get out of this town.

1607
01:34:59,772 --> 01:35:02,151
But don't you want to get a better peek at
it?

1608
01:35:02,707 --> 01:35:04,792
It doesn't cost anything to look,
you know?

1609
01:35:08,954 --> 01:35:09,954
Lady Tsunade?

1610
01:35:13,287 --> 01:35:15,167
<i>What is this chill I'm feeling?</i>

1611
01:36:29,791 --> 01:36:31,796
<i>This kid is something else.</i>

1612
01:36:31,829 --> 01:36:34,561
<i>The chakra was so dense it burned his
palm.</i>

1613
01:36:35,909 --> 01:36:38,038
One surprise after another.

1614
01:36:43,628 --> 01:36:44,772
What do you know?

1615
01:36:44,796 --> 01:36:45,796
It finally popped.

1616
01:36:46,102 --> 01:36:47,102
Well done.

1617
01:36:47,126 --> 01:36:49,146
It looks like you've mastered the second
step.

1618
01:36:49,780 --> 01:36:50,780
Come on, then.

1619
01:36:51,280 --> 01:36:52,804
Let me hear the third one.

1620
01:36:52,830 --> 01:36:54,050
That'll have to wait for now.

1621
01:36:54,840 --> 01:36:57,280
It's time for us to meet up with Tsunade.

1622
01:37:08,852 --> 01:37:10,044
Isn't that..?

1623
01:37:14,683 --> 01:37:16,292
Orochimaru...

1624
01:37:18,093 --> 01:37:20,093
[evil laugh]

1625
01:37:23,456 --> 01:37:25,649
I finally found you.

1626
01:37:26,259 --> 01:37:28,259
[credits music plays]

1627
01:38:24,040 --> 01:38:27,540
A little pause...
and we are back.

1628
01:38:28,060 --> 01:38:32,020
A little pause... and we are back.

